#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/agent.rst:4
msgid ""
"本页用于查智能体生命周期、工作区与交互方法。构造流程和可运行示例见 :doc:`/agents`；新增人物行为时，先判断是否只需编写 "
":doc:`/agent_skills`。"
msgstr ""
"Look up agent lifecycle, workspace and interaction methods here. Construction and "
"examples are in :doc:`/agents`; consider :doc:`/agent_skills` first when adding "
"person behavior."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/agent.rst:6
msgid "记忆存储与配置类型见 :doc:`memory`；技能注册与运行时见 :doc:`skills`。"
msgstr ""
"See :doc:`memory` for memory storage and configuration types, and :doc:`skills` for skill "
"registration and runtime interfaces."

