msgid ":meth:`step`"
msgstr ":meth:`step`"

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.__init__:1 of
msgid "初始化一个未绑定的 agent(无参)。"
msgstr "Initialize an unbound agent (arg-less)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.__init__:3 of
msgid "只设置空槽位;不解析 profile,也不要求 id。真正的初始化发生在 :meth:`restore` 中（由 :meth:`from_workspace` 调用）。"
msgstr ""
"Only empty slots are set; no profile parsing and no id required. The real "
"initialization happens in :meth:`restore` (invoked by :meth:`from_workspace`)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.create:1 of
msgid "创建初始 agent workspace(静态、一次写定的 config)。"
msgstr "Create the initial agent workspace (static, write-once config)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.create:3 of
msgid "写入 ``config.json``(静态、永不重写)+ 初始 ``AGENT.json`` + 标准空目录。不返回 agent 实例;重建请使用 :meth:`from_workspace` 。"
msgstr ""
"Writes ``config.json`` (static, never rewritten) + the initial ``AGENT.json`` + the standard "
"empty directories. Does NOT return an agent instance; use :meth:`from_workspace` to reconstruct."

