msgstr "Write the current dynamic state back to the workspace."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask:1 of
msgid "经由 agent 的推理流程回答一个外部问题。"
msgstr "Answer an external question through the agent's reasoning flow."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.step:1 of
