msgstr "Run one simulation step."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.AgentBase.id:1 of
msgid "Agent 唯一标识符。"
msgstr "Unique agent identifier."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.AgentBase.name:1 of
msgid "Agent 显示名。"
msgstr "Agent display name."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:1 of
msgid "向环境 router 发送一个请求。"
msgstr "Send a request to the environment router."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:3 of
msgid "封装与仿真环境的交互,支持 template 模式与上下文变量替换。"
msgstr ""
"Wraps interaction with the simulation environment, supporting template mode and "
"context-variable substitution."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:5 of
msgid "上下文 dict(template 模式下可含 ``variables`` 键)。"
msgstr "Context dict (in template mode, may include a ``variables`` key)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:6 of
msgid "请求消息。"
msgstr "Request message."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:7 of
msgid "是否为只读请求。"
msgstr "Whether this is a read-only request."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:8 of
msgid "是否启用 template 模式。"
msgstr "Whether to enable template mode."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:9 of
msgid "用于跨 agent/env 关联的 OTel trace ID。"
msgstr "OTel trace ID for cross-agent/env correlation."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:10
#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_trace_context:7 of
msgid "父追踪片段的 ID。"
msgstr "Parent span ID."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.ask_env:11 of
msgid "元组 ``(ctx, answer)`` 。"
msgstr "Tuple ``(ctx, answer)``."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.acompletion:1 of
msgid "经由绑定的 default 角色调度器执行一次 LLM 补全。"
msgstr "One LLM completion via the bound default-role dispatcher."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.acompletion:3 of
msgid ""
"供需要一次性 LLM 调用的子类使用的便捷入口(完整的多轮工具循环见 :meth:`run_react_loop`)。使用 agent 绑定的 dispatcher + "
"model。"
msgstr ""
"Convenience entry point for subclasses that need a one-shot LLM call (the full multi-"
"turn tool loop is :meth:`run_react_loop`). Uses the agent's bound dispatcher + model."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.acompletion:6 of
msgid ""
"截断兜底:思考型模型的推理偶尔远超网关默认输出上限——思考链耗尽全部预算,``finish_reason`` 返回 ``\"length\"`` 且 ``content`` "
"为空。恰好命中该签名时,以宽裕的显式 ``max_tokens`` 重试一次(保留思考——故障在上限而非推理本身);其余空内容形态留给调用方处理。"
msgstr ""
"Truncation fallback: thinking-model reasoning occasionally far exceeds the gateway's default "
"output cap — the chain of thought exhausts the entire budget, ``finish_reason`` comes back "
"``\"length\"`` with empty ``content``. On exactly that signature, retry once with a generous "
"explicit ``max_tokens`` (keep thinking — the failure is in the cap, not the reasoning itself); "
"other empty-content shapes are left to the caller."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.acompletion:11 of
msgid "聊天消息列表。"
msgstr "Chat message list."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.acompletion:12 of
msgid "流式开关(恒为 False;本地调度器不支持流式)。"
msgstr "Streaming flag (always False; the local dispatcher does not support streaming)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.acompletion:13 of
msgid "透传给 litellm 的附加参数(timeout、tools 等)。"
msgstr "Extra kwargs passed through to litellm (timeout, tools, ...)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.acompletion:14 of
msgid "litellm ``ModelResponse`` 响应对象。"
msgstr "The litellm ``ModelResponse`` object."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.close:1 of
msgid "关闭 agent 并释放资源。子类可覆写。"
msgstr "Close the agent and release resources. Subclasses may override."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.get_profile:1 of
msgid "以 dict 形式返回 agent profile。"
msgstr "Return the agent profile as a dict."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.get_profile:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "profile dict(原始 dict、``model_dump`` 或 ``{\"raw\": str}``)。"
msgstr "Profile dict (raw dict, ``model_dump``, or ``{\"raw\": str}``)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.description:1 of
msgid "返回用于模块清单的 agent 简短描述。"
msgstr "Return a short agent description for module lists."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.init_description:1 of
msgid "返回本 agent 类的可供 AI 阅读的初始化指引。"
msgstr "Return AI-readable initialization guidance for this agent class."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.workspace_root_path:1 of
msgid "返回 agent 持有的 workspace 根目录。"
msgstr "Return the agent-owned workspace root."

