msgstr "Raised when the workspace is not initialized."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.trace_span:1 of
msgid "创建一个 agent 持有的 trace span 上下文。"
msgstr "Create an agent-owned trace span context."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_agent_json:1 of
msgid "构建 agent 的整合式自描述文件。"
msgstr "Build the agent's consolidated self-description file."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_agent_json:3 of
msgid "子类可覆写以追加额外字段(如 memory 摘要)。"
msgstr "Subclasses may override to append extra fields (e.g. a memory summary)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_agent_json:5
#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:15
#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_turn_state:6
#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.persist_agent_json:3 of
msgid "当前仿真 tick(若可用)。"
msgstr "Current simulation tick, if available."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_agent_json:6
#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:16
#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_turn_state:7
#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.persist_agent_json:4 of
msgid "当前仿真时间(若可用)。"
msgstr "Current simulation time, if available."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_agent_json:7 of
msgid "可序列化的 AGENT.json dict。"
msgstr "Serializable AGENT.json dictionary."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:1 of
msgid "把 AGENT.json 投影为其运行稳定、prompt 安全的子集。"
msgstr "Project AGENT.json into its run-stable, prompt-safe subset."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:3 of
msgid ""
":meth:`build_agent_json` 是持久化的 AGENT.json 载荷——由 resume 路径读回,且被文档化为子类扩展点,因此保持原样。本投影剔除不应进入 prompt "
"的部分:"
msgstr ""
":meth:`build_agent_json` is the persisted AGENT.json payload — it is read back by the resume path"
" and documented as a subclass extension point, so it stays as-is. This projection strips the "
"parts that must not enter the prompt:"

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:7 of
msgid "``initialized_at`` —— 挂钟时间,逐 agent、逐运行地不同。"
msgstr "``initialized_at`` — wall-clock time, differs per agent and per run."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:8 of
msgid ""
"``current_time`` / ``tick`` / ``step_count`` —— 每个 step 都变化, 因此改由独立的 ``<turn_state>``"
" 块输出,置于运行稳定块之后。"
msgstr ""
"``current_time`` / ``tick`` / ``step_count`` — change on every step, so they are "
"emitted by the separate ``<turn_state>`` block placed after the run-stable blocks."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:10 of
msgid "``workspace.root`` —— 宿主机绝对路径,对模型无用(所有 workspace 工具接收 workspace 相对路径)。"
msgstr ""
"``workspace.root`` — a host-machine absolute path, useless to the model (all "
"workspace tools take workspace-relative paths)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:13 of
msgid ":meth:`build_agent_json` 覆写追加的子类额外字段会保留。"
msgstr "Subclass extra fields appended by :meth:`build_agent_json` overrides are kept."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_agent_view:17 of
msgid "agent 自描述的 prompt 安全视图。"
msgstr "Prompt-safe view of the agent self-description."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_turn_state:1 of
msgid "构建逐 step 的 ``<turn_state>`` 块载荷。"
msgstr "Build the per-step ``<turn_state>`` block payload."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_turn_state:3 of
msgid "在一个仿真 step 内的所有 ReAct 轮次间保持恒定,因而渲染在 ``<recent_observations>`` 之前。"
msgstr ""
"Stays constant across all ReAct turns within one simulation step, hence it is "
"rendered before ``<recent_observations>``."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.build_prompt_turn_state:8 of
msgid "逐 step 的状态 dict。"
msgstr "Per-step state dict."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.persist_agent_json:1 of
msgid "将整合的 agent 自描述持久化到 AGENT.json。"
msgstr "Persist the consolidated agent self-description to AGENT.json."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.persist_agent_json:5 of
msgid "写入 AGENT.json 的数据。"
msgstr "Data written to AGENT.json."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.discover_skill_sources:1 of
msgid "发现 custom 与环境提供的技能来源。"
msgstr "Discover custom and environment-provided skill sources."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.discover_skill_sources:3 of
msgid "先扫描默认的 ``<root>/custom/skills`` 位置(``env.run_dir`` 与本 agent 的 workspace 根目录),再扫描由两个来源合并出的额外技能目录:"
msgstr ""
"Scans the default ``<root>/custom/skills`` locations first (``env.run_dir`` and this agent's "
"workspace root), then any extra skill directories merged from two sources:"

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.discover_skill_sources:7 of
msgid "声明式:``config.json`` 中的 ``extra_skill_paths`` (在 :meth:`restore` 中解析);"
msgstr "declarative: ``extra_skill_paths`` in ``config.json`` (resolved in :meth:`restore`);"

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.discover_skill_sources:9 of
msgid "程序式:此处的 ``extra_skill_paths`` 参数。"
msgstr "programmatic: the ``extra_skill_paths`` argument here."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.discover_skill_sources:10 of
msgid ""
"每个额外条目都是一个包含技能子目录的目录(与 ``custom/skills`` 布局相同)。相对条目以 workspace 根目录解析。两者都未给出时默认扫描不变,agent "
"可经任一入口加载存放在任意位置的 custom skills。"
msgstr ""
"Each extra entry is a directory containing skill subdirectories (same layout as "
"``custom/skills``). Relative entries resolve against the workspace root. When neither is given, "
"the default scan is unchanged, so an agent can load custom skills stored anywhere via either "
"entry point."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.agent.AgentBase.discover_skill_sources:15 of
msgid "用于定位 run 目录与模块的环境 router。"
