msgstr ""
"Splits the AGENT.json content into the two prompt blocks the layout needs: the run-"
"stable ``<agent>`` identity view (volatile and host-path fields stripped) and the "
"per-step ``<turn_state>``. Both come from the same source dict, so they cannot drift "
"apart."

#: agentsociety2.agent.person.PersonAgent.build_context_refresh_message:1 of
