#: agentsociety2.agent.person.PersonAgent.build_context_refresh_message:3 of
msgid ""
"线程头每个 step 只构建一次(正是它保证了缓存前缀不被破坏),因此 ``<todo_context>`` 与系统 ``<skill_content>`` "
"块若不刷新,就会在 step 余下部分保持过期。"
msgstr ""
"The thread head is built once per step (precisely what keeps the cached prefix "
"intact), so ``<todo_context>`` and the system ``<skill_content>`` blocks stay stale "
"for the rest of the step unless refreshed."

#: agentsociety2.agent.person.PersonAgent.build_context_refresh_message:7 of
msgid ""
"TODO 变更重发 ``<todo_context>``:它聚合单个工具 observation 不含的状态(``due_now`` 、``overdue_or_blocked`` "
"、``counts``)。"
msgstr ""
"TODO changes re-send ``<todo_context>``: it aggregates state no single tool observation contains "
"(``due_now``, ``overdue_or_blocked``, ``counts``)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.person.PersonAgent.build_context_refresh_message:8 of
msgid ""
"skill 变更只重发激活 skill 的**清单**,不重发其文档: ``activate_skill`` 已把完整 SKILL.md 作为工具 observation 返回,在此重复会使多 "
"KB 块翻倍。清单才是 ``deactivate_skill`` 真正需要的; observation 无法撤回模型已读过的内容。"
msgstr ""
"Skill changes re-send only the **catalog** of activated skills, not their docs: "
"``activate_skill`` already returned the full SKILL.md as a tool observation, and repeating it "
"here would double the multi-KB block. The catalog is what ``deactivate_skill`` actually needs; an"
" observation cannot un-read what the model has already seen."

