msgid "尾部文本；源文件以换行符结尾时保留最后的换行符。"
msgstr "Trailing text, preserving a final newline when the source had one."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.experiments.read_log_tail:9 of
msgid "当 ``tail < 1`` 时抛出。"
msgstr "If ``tail < 1``."

