#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/config.rst:62
msgid "Config 类"
msgstr "Config class"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config:1 of
msgid "AgentSociety2 配置（环境变量来源）。"
msgstr "AgentSociety2 configuration (environment variable source)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config:3 of
msgid "该类以“类属性”的形式暴露配置项，便于在不实例化的情况下读取。"
msgstr ""
"This class exposes configuration items in the form of \"class attributes\" for easy "
"reading without instantiation."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config:5 of
msgid "主要环境变量（节选）："
msgstr "Main environment variables (excerpt):"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config:7 of
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_HOME_DIR`` ：数据目录"
msgstr "``AGENTSOCIETY_HOME_DIR``: Data directory"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config:8 of
msgid ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_KEY`` / ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE`` / "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL`` ：默认模型配置"
msgstr ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_KEY`` / ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE`` / "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL``: Default model configuration"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config:9 of
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_*`` ：代码生成模型配置"
msgstr "``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_*``: Code generation model configuration"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config:10 of
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_*`` ：embedding 配置"
msgstr "``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_*``：embedding configuration"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.HOME_DIR:1 of
msgid "存储 agent 数据、记忆与持久化文件的基础目录路径。"
msgstr "Base directory path for storing agent data, memories, and persistent files."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.HOME_DIR:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_HOME_DIR`` 默认：\"``./agentsociety_data``\""
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_HOME_DIR`` Default: \"``./agentsociety_data``\""

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.HOME_DIR:6 of
msgid "该目录下会包含记忆、agent 状态等持久化数据的子目录。路径可为绝对路径，也可以是相对当前工作目录的相对路径。"
msgstr ""
"This directory will contain subdirectories for memories, agent states, and other persistent data."
" The path can be absolute or relative to the current working directory."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_API_KEY:1 of
msgid "默认 LLM 服务的认证 API key。"
msgstr "API key for authenticating with the default LLM service."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_API_KEY:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_KEY`` 默认：None（系统要正常运行必须设置）"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_KEY`` Default: None (must be set for the system to "
"function)"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_API_KEY:6 of
msgid ""
"这是大多数 LLM 操作使用的主 API key。若未设置，系统在创建 LLM Router 时会抛出异常。其他专用 LLM 配置（coder、embedding）在未提供各自 key "
"时会回退到该 key。"
msgstr ""
"This is the primary API key used for most LLM operations. If not set, the system will raise an "
"error when attempting to create LLM routers. Other specialized LLM configurations (coder, nano, "
"embedding) will fall back to this key if their specific keys are not provided."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_API_BASE:1 of
msgid "默认 LLM API 服务的基础 URL 端点。"
msgstr "Base URL endpoint for the default LLM API service."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_API_BASE:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE`` 默认：``https://api.openai.com/v1``。"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE``. Default: ``https://api.openai.com/v1``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_API_BASE:6 of
msgid ""
"应指向所选 LiteLLM provider 所要求的 API 端点。对 OpenAI 兼容网关，需包含协议（``https://``）与基础路径，但不包含具体模型端点（如 "
"``/chat/completions``）。"
msgstr ""
"Use the API endpoint required by the selected LiteLLM provider. An OpenAI-compatible gateway URL "
"must include the scheme (``https://``) and base path, but not a model-specific endpoint such as "
"``/chat/completions``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_MODEL:1 of
msgid "通用操作所用默认 LLM 的模型标识。"
msgstr "Model identifier for the default LLM used in general operations."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_MODEL:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL`` 默认：\"gpt-5.5\""
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL`` Default: \"gpt-5.5\""

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_MODEL:6 of
msgid ""
"该模型用于大多数无需专用模型的语言理解与生成任务。模型名应与 API 供应商处 LiteLLM 的 provider/model id 一致；\"gpt-5.5\" 只是默认的 OpenAI "
"示例。"
msgstr ""
"This model is used for most language understanding and generation tasks that don't require "
"specialized models. The model name should match the LiteLLM provider/model id used by your API "
"provider; \"gpt-5.5\" is only the default OpenAI example."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_API_KEY:1 of
msgid "代码生成 LLM 服务的 API key。"
msgstr "API key for the code generation LLM service."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_API_KEY:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_API_KEY`` 默认：未设置时回退到 ``LLM_API_KEY``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_API_KEY`` Default: Falls back to ``LLM_API_KEY`` "
"if not set"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_API_KEY:6 of
msgid "该 key 专用于代码相关操作。若未提供，系统会使用默认的 ``LLM_API_KEY``。单独设置该 key 可为代码生成任务使用不同的 API 供应商或账户，其速率限制或计费结构可能不同。"
msgstr ""
"This key is used specifically for code-related operations. If not provided, the system will use "
"the default ``LLM_API_KEY``. Setting a separate key allows you to use a different API provider or"
" account for code generation tasks, which may have different rate limits or pricing structures."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_API_BASE:1 of
msgid "代码生成 LLM API 的基础 URL 端点。"
msgstr "Base URL endpoint for the code generation LLM API."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_API_BASE:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_API_BASE`` 默认：未设置时回退到 ``LLM_API_BASE``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_API_BASE`` Default: Falls back to ``LLM_API_BASE``"
" if not set"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_API_BASE:6 of
msgid "允许为代码生成任务单独使用不同的 API 端点。若希望把代码生成请求路由到其他服务或区域，以获得更好的性能或成本优化，会很有用。"
msgstr ""
"Allows you to use a different API endpoint specifically for code generation tasks. This is useful"
" if you want to route code generation requests to a different service or region for better "
"performance or cost optimization."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_MODEL:1 of
msgid "代码生成与编程任务的模型标识。"
msgstr "Model identifier for code generation and programming tasks."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_MODEL:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_MODEL`` 默认：未设置时回退到 ``LLM_MODEL``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_MODEL`` Default: Falls back to ``LLM_MODEL`` if "
"not set"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_MODEL:6 of
msgid "该模型专用于代码生成、代码分析等编程相关操作。请选择针对代码理解与生成优化过的模型，例如在代码库上训练过的模型。"
msgstr ""
"This model is specifically used for code generation, code analysis, and other programming-related"
" operations. Choose a model that is optimized for code understanding and generation, such as "
"models trained on codebases."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_API_KEY:1 of
msgid "Embedding 模型服务的 API key。"
msgstr "API key for the embedding model service."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_API_KEY:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_API_KEY`` 默认：未设置时回退到 ``LLM_API_KEY``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_API_KEY`` Default: Falls back to ``LLM_API_KEY`` "
"if not set"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_API_KEY:6 of
msgid "该 key 专用于 embedding 操作——把文本转换为高维向量，用于语义搜索、相似度匹配与记忆操作。部分供应商提供计费不同的独立 embedding 服务。"
msgstr ""
"This key is used specifically for embedding operations, which convert text into high-dimensional "
"vectors for semantic search, similarity matching, and memory operations. Some providers offer "
"separate embedding services with different pricing."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_API_BASE:1 of
msgid "Embedding API 服务的基础 URL 端点。"
msgstr "Base URL endpoint for the embedding API service."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_API_BASE:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_API_BASE`` 默认：未设置时回退到 ``LLM_API_BASE``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_API_BASE`` Default: Falls back to ``LLM_API_BASE``"
" if not set"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_API_BASE:6 of
msgid ""
"允许为 embedding 操作单独使用不同的 API 端点。部分供应商提供专用的 embedding 端点，可能为 embedding "
"任务提供更好的性能或不同的计费模式。"
msgstr ""
"Allows you to use a different API endpoint specifically for embedding operations. "
"Some providers have dedicated embedding endpoints that may offer better performance "
"or different pricing models for embedding tasks."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_MODEL:1 of
msgid "文本 embedding 生成的模型标识。"
msgstr "Model identifier for text embedding generation."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_MODEL:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_MODEL`` 默认：\"text-embedding-3-large\""
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_MODEL`` Default: \"text-embedding-3-large\""

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_MODEL:6 of
msgid ""
"该模型用于把文本转换为稠密向量表示（embedding）。embedding 用于语义搜索、相似度匹配以及把记忆存入向量数据库。请选择在你的使用场景与语言下能产出高质量 embedding "
"的模型。"
msgstr ""
"This model is used to convert text into dense vector representations (embeddings). The embeddings"
" are used for semantic search, similarity matching, and storing memories in vector databases. "
"Choose a model that produces high-quality embeddings for your use case and language."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_DIMS:1 of
msgid "Embedding 模型产出的向量维度。"
msgstr "Dimensionality of the embedding vectors produced by the embedding model."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_DIMS:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_DIMS`` 默认：1024"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_EMBEDDING_DIMS`` Default: 1024"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.EMBEDDING_DIMS:6 of
msgid ""
"指定 embedding 的向量空间大小。维度越高能捕捉越细腻的语义信息，但存储与计算开销也更大。该值必须与所选 embedding 模型的实际输出维度一致；常见取值为 "
"384、512、768、1024 或 1536，取决于具体模型。"
msgstr ""
"This specifies the size of the vector space for embeddings. Higher dimensions can capture more "
"nuanced semantic information but require more storage and computation. The value must match the "
"actual output dimensionality of the selected embedding model. Common values are 384, 512, 768, "
"1024, or 1536 depending on the model."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_LATENCY_DEGRADE_FACTOR:1 of
msgid ""
"AIMD 的相对延迟退避因子。一次无错误的 LLM 调用，当延迟超过 ``baseline * factor`` 时记为“慢”（并计入一次 AIMD 降并发），其中 "
"``baseline`` 是近期健康延迟的滚动低分位数（P25）。"
msgstr ""
"Relative latency backoff factor for AIMD. A non-error LLM call is counted as \"slow\""
" (and contributes to an AIMD decrease) when its latency exceeds ``baseline * "
"factor``, where ``baseline`` is a rolling low-percentile (P25) of recent healthy "
"latencies."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_LATENCY_DEGRADE_FACTOR:5 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_LATENCY_DEGRADE_FACTOR`` 默认：4.0"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_LATENCY_DEGRADE_FACTOR`` Default: 4.0"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_LATENCY_DEGRADE_FACTOR:8 of
msgid ""
"baseline 跟踪快路径，因此只有调用相对近期良好表现确实变慢时才触发——对初始并发突发具有鲁棒性。设为很大的值（或 ``inf`` "
"）可禁用相对延迟退避，仅依赖限流（429）错误（即旧行为）。"
msgstr ""
"The baseline tracks the fast path, so it only triggers when a call is genuinely slower than "
"recent good performance — robust to initial concurrency bursts. Set a very large value (or "
"``inf``) to disable relative latency backoff and rely solely on rate-limit (429) errors (the old "
"behavior)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_SLOW_LATENCY_MS:1 of
msgid ""
"可选的绝对 SLO 上限（毫秒）。无错误的 LLM 调用只要慢于该值即记为“慢”，与滚动 baseline 无关。即便持续争用已把整体 baseline "
"抬高（此时相对因子失明），也能捕捉到病态长尾。"
msgstr ""
"Optional absolute SLO ceiling in milliseconds. A non-error LLM call slower than this counts as "
"\"slow\" regardless of the rolling baseline. Catches pathological tails even when sustained "
"contention has pushed the whole baseline up (where the relative factor goes blind)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_SLOW_LATENCY_MS:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_SLOW_LATENCY_MS`` 默认：未设置（仅启用相对因子退避）"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_SLOW_LATENCY_MS`` Default: unset (relative-factor "
"backoff only)"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_ROUND_SAMPLE_CAP:1 of
msgid "AIMD 轮次规模的上限（每次调整评估的补全数）。不设上限时轮次规模会随并发上限增长，上限很大时自适应会变得迟钝（如上限 400 → 需 400 次补全才调整一次）。"
msgstr ""
"Upper bound on AIMD round size (completions evaluated per adjustment). Without this cap, round "
"size grows with the limit, so a large limit makes adaptation sluggish (e.g. limit 400 → 400 "
"completions before any adjust)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_ROUND_SAMPLE_CAP:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_ROUND_SAMPLE_CAP`` 默认：64"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_ROUND_SAMPLE_CAP`` Default: 64"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS:1 of
msgid "作为 Ray CPU 预算提示的上限（``ray.init(num_cpus=...)`` ）。"
msgstr "Upper bound used as the Ray CPU budget hint (``ray.init(num_cpus=...)``)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` 默认：机器逻辑 CPU 核数（``os.cpu_count()`` ）。"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` Default: machine logical CPU count "
"(``os.cpu_count()``)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS:6 of
msgid ""
"限制每个 tick 并发运行的 ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task 数（每个 ``BATCH_SIZE`` 大小的 agent 分片一个 "
"task）。可将其调低到物理核数之下，为 driver、env-router actor 以及 trace/replay actor 留出余量。"
msgstr ""
"Caps how many ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Tasks run concurrently per tick (one task per "
"``BATCH_SIZE`` chunk of agents). Lower this below the physical core count to leave headroom for "
"the driver, the env-router actor, and the trace/replay actors."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY:1 of
msgid "本地 LLM 调度的每进程初始并发。"
msgstr "Initial per-process concurrency for local LLM dispatching."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY`` 默认：16"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY`` Default: 16"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY:6 of
msgid "每个本地 ``LLMClient`` 的 AIMD 信号量由此初始并发出发进行调优。没有硬性上下限——各进程基于观测到的延迟与限流错误，通过 AIMD（加性增 / 乘性减）自由调整并发。"
msgstr ""
"The starting concurrency each local ``LLMClient`` AIMD semaphore tunes from. There is no hard "
"upper/lower cap — each process adjusts its concurrency freely via AIMD (additive increase / "
"multiplicative decrease) based on observed latency and rate-limit errors."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_TIMEOUT:1 of
msgid "生成的代码与工具的执行时限（秒）。process 后端强制硬性墙钟时限； inprocess 使用协作式 Python 检查。"
msgstr ""
"Execution limit for generated code and tools, in seconds. The process backend "
"enforces a hard wall-clock limit; inprocess uses cooperative Python checks."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_TIMEOUT:4 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_TIMEOUT``"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_TIMEOUT``"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_BACKEND:1 of
msgid "完整 Python 执行后端：默认 inprocess；process 启用 worker 隔离。"
msgstr "Full Python execution backend: inprocess by default; process enables worker isolation."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_BACKEND:3 of
msgid "Inprocess 使用协作式 Python 截止时间与部署级资源限制。环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_BACKEND``"
msgstr ""
"Inprocess uses cooperative Python deadlines and deployment resource limits. Environment variable:"
" ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_BACKEND``"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_MEMORY_MIB:1 of
msgid "单个数值计算 worker 的地址空间上限（含其 Python/NumPy 运行时）。"
msgstr "Address-space limit per numerical worker, including its Python/NumPy runtime."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_MEMORY_MIB:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_MEMORY_MIB``"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_MEMORY_MIB``"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_WORKERS:1 of
msgid "同一事件循环上各 router 共享的数值计算 worker 数上限。"
msgstr "Maximum numerical workers shared by routers on the same event loop."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODE_EXEC_WORKERS:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_WORKERS``"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODE_EXEC_WORKERS``"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.BATCH_SIZE:1 of
msgid "每个 ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task 处理的 agent 数。"
msgstr "Number of agents per ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.BATCH_SIZE:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE`` 默认：256"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE`` Default: 256"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.BATCH_SIZE:6 of
msgid ""
"每个仿真 tick 把 agent id 列表按该大小分片，每片提交一个 Ray Task （``tasks = ceil(N / BATCH_SIZE)`` ）。并发运行的 task 至多 "
"``LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` 个，因此应选取满足 ``ceil(N / BATCH_SIZE) >= LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` 的取值以喂饱 "
"worker；否则部分 worker 会闲置。分片过小增加调度开销；过大则一个慢 agent 会拖住整个分片。"
msgstr ""
"Each simulation tick chunks the agent id list into batches of this size and submits one Ray Task "
"per chunk (``tasks = ceil(N / BATCH_SIZE)``). At most ``LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` tasks run "
"concurrently, so choose a size where ``ceil(N / BATCH_SIZE) >= LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` to saturate "
"the workers; otherwise some workers sit idle. Smaller batches add scheduling overhead; larger "
"batches mean one slow agent can stall its whole batch."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.WORKSPACE_READ_MAX_BYTES:1 of
msgid "agent ``read`` 工具返回字节数的硬上限。"
msgstr "Hard cap on bytes returned by the agent ``read`` tool."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.WORKSPACE_READ_MAX_BYTES:3 of
msgid ""
"观测结果会并入 react 线程，并在后续每一轮重发（无缓存尾部），因此一个大文件会在本 step 余下的轮次中同时推高上下文与成本。超限的读取会被截断并附带标记；模型会被引导改用 "
"``grep`` 做定向提取。"
msgstr ""
"The observation joins the react thread and is re-sent (uncached tail) on every subsequent turn, "
"so one huge file balloons both context and cost for the rest of the step. Larger reads are "
"truncated with a marker; the model is pointed at ``grep`` for targeted extraction."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.WORKSPACE_READ_MAX_BYTES:5 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_WORKSPACE_READ_MAX_BYTES`` 默认：65536（64 KiB）"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_WORKSPACE_READ_MAX_BYTES`` Default: 65536 (64 KiB)"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_THINKING:1 of
msgid "是否启用模型推理（thinking）：``on`` / ``off`` （兼容 ``1/0/true/false`` ）。"
msgstr "Whether to enable model thinking: ``on`` / ``off`` (also accepts ``1/0/true/false``)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_THINKING:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING`` 默认：未设置（**不发送任何新参数**，行为与未启用该功能时完全一致）"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING`` Default: unset (**no new parameters are "
"sent**, behavior is identical to when the feature is disabled)"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_THINKING:6 of
msgid ""
"OpenAI 接口关闭时发送 ``reasoning_effort=\"none\"`` ，开启时默认 ``medium`` 。 Anthropic Messages 接口发送显式 "
"``thinking`` 开关，开启默认预算 1024 tokens。 ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` 可声明其他网关的原生开关。接口协议由 "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_TYPE`` 选择，默认 ``openai`` 。"
msgstr ""
"For the OpenAI API, sends ``reasoning_effort=\"none\"`` when off and defaults to ``medium`` when "
"on. The Anthropic Messages API gets an explicit ``thinking`` switch with a default budget of 1024"
" tokens when on. ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` can declare native switches for other gateways. "
"The API protocol is selected by ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_TYPE``, defaulting to ``openai``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_REASONING_EFFORT:1 of
msgid ""
"显式的 ``reasoning_effort`` 取值（``minimal`` / ``low`` / ``medium`` / ``high`` / ``xhigh``"
" / ``max`` ）。"
msgstr ""
"Explicit ``reasoning_effort`` value (``minimal`` / ``low`` / ``medium`` / ``high`` / "
"``xhigh`` / ``max``)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_REASONING_EFFORT:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT`` 默认：未设置（OpenAI 接口 ``on`` 默认 ``medium`` ；关闭不使用推理强度）"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT`` Default: unset (OpenAI ``on`` "
"defaults to ``medium``; no reasoning effort is sent when off)"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_EXTRA_BODY:1 of
msgid "网关私有的 OpenAI 兼容开关，JSON 对象字符串，合并进请求的 ``extra_body`` 。"
msgstr ""
"Gateway-private OpenAI-compatible switches, as a JSON object string, merged into the "
"request's ``extra_body``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_EXTRA_BODY:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` 默认：未设置"
msgstr "Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` Default: unset"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LLM_EXTRA_BODY:6 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"例：``{\"enable_thinking\": false}`` 、``{\"thinking\": {\"type\": \"disabled\"}}`` 、 "
"``{\"chat_template_kwargs\": {\"enable_thinking\": false}}`` 。JSON 解析失败只记 warning "
"并忽略，不会中断实验。"
msgstr ""
"Examples: ``{\"enable_thinking\": false}``, ``{\"thinking\": {\"type\": "
"\"disabled\"}}``, ``{\"chat_template_kwargs\": {\"enable_thinking\": false}}``. JSON "
"parse failures only log a warning and are ignored; they never interrupt an "
"experiment."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_THINKING:1 of
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING`` 的 coder 角色覆盖（env router 的代码生成）。"
msgstr "Coder-role override of ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING`` (env router code generation)."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_THINKING:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_THINKING`` 默认：回退到 ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_THINKING`` Default: falls back to "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING``"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT:1 of
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT`` 的 coder 角色覆盖。"
msgstr "Coder-role override of ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT`` 默认：回退到 ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT`` Default: falls back to "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT``"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_EXTRA_BODY:1 of
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` 的 coder 角色覆盖。"
msgstr "Coder-role override of ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.CODER_LLM_EXTRA_BODY:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` 默认：回退到 ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY``"
msgstr ""
"Environment variable: ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` Default: falls back to "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY``"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL:1 of
msgid "学术文献检索的 MCP 网关 URL（Streamable HTTP）。"
msgstr "MCP gateway URL (Streamable HTTP) for academic literature search."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL:3 of
