#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY:1 of
msgid "文献 MCP 鉴权使用的 Bearer token。"
msgstr "Bearer token used for literature MCP authentication."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.Config.LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY:3 of
msgid "环境变量：``LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY`` 默认：\"\"（为空；发起鉴权请求前必须设置）"
