msgstr "Parse thinking settings for a role and return arguments for ``ThinkingSettings``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.get_llm_thinking:3 of
msgid "环境变量（``coder`` 角色优先读 ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_*`` ，未设时回退到默认组；其他角色只读默认组）："
msgstr ""
"Environment variables: the ``coder`` role prefers ``AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_*`` and falls back to "
"the default group; other roles read the default group:"

#: agentsociety2.config.config.get_llm_thinking:5 of
msgid ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING`` ：``on`` / ``off`` （兼容 ``1/0/true/false`` ）。**未设 = "
"不发送任何新参数**，出站请求与不启用该功能时逐字节相同。"
msgstr ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_THINKING``: ``on`` / ``off`` (also accepts ``1/0/true/false``). **Unset means "
"no additional parameters**; outgoing requests remain unchanged by this feature."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.get_llm_thinking:8 of
