msgstr "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT``: sent as ``reasoning_effort``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.get_llm_thinking:7 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY`` ：JSON 对象，合并进 ``extra_body`` ，用于网关私有开关（如 ``{\"enable_thinking\": "
"false}`` ）。"
msgstr ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_EXTRA_BODY``: a JSON object merged into ``extra_body`` for gateway-specific "
"controls such as ``{\"enable_thinking\": false}``."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.get_llm_thinking:12 of
msgid "``ThinkingSettings`` 按实际接口生成开启或关闭参数；关闭不使用推理强度。 ``extra_body`` 可提供网关原生的推理开关，其他字段继续保留。"
msgstr ""
"``ThinkingSettings`` generates protocol-specific enabled or disabled parameters. "
"``extra_body`` can provide native gateway thinking controls while retaining other "
"fields."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.get_llm_thinking:15 of
msgid ""
"这里刻意在**调用时**读 ``os.getenv`` （而非只在 import 时读），以便测试用 monkeypatch 覆盖；``Config`` "
"上的同名类属性仅作文档用途。"
msgstr ""
"Environment variables are read **at call time**, rather than only at import time, so "
"tests can override them with monkeypatch. The corresponding ``Config`` class "
"attributes serve as documentation."

#: agentsociety2.config.config.get_llm_thinking:18 of
