#: agentsociety2.env.router_two_tier_plan_execute.TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter.__init__:6
#: agentsociety2.env.router_two_tier_react.TwoTierReActRouter.__init__:6 of
msgid "可选回放写入器；若提供会自动注入到各 env module。"
msgstr ""
"Optional replay writer; when provided, it is automatically injected into each env "
"module."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.__init__:7
#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CodeGenRouter.__init__:7
#: agentsociety2.env.router_plan_execute.PlanExecuteRouter.__init__:7
#: agentsociety2.env.router_react.ReActRouter.__init__:7
#: agentsociety2.env.router_search_tool.SearchToolRouter.__init__:7
#: agentsociety2.env.router_two_tier_plan_execute.TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter.__init__:7
#: agentsociety2.env.router_two_tier_react.TwoTierReActRouter.__init__:7 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"可选。注入的 :class:`LLMClient` 句柄映射， 例如 ``{\"coder\": \"LLMClient\", \"default\": "
"\"LLMClient\"}`` 。提供时 router 使用注入的 client；为空时按配置构建本地 client。"
msgstr ""
"Optional injected :class:`LLMClient` handle mapping, such as ``{\"coder\": "
"\"LLMClient\", \"default\": \"LLMClient\"}``. When provided, the router uses the "
"injected clients; when empty, it builds local clients from configuration."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_trace_sink:1 of
msgid "注入用于 env 侧 trace span 的同步 sharded-writer 适配器。"
msgstr "Inject a sync sharded-writer adapter for env-side trace spans."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_trace_sink:3 of
msgid ""
"暴露 ``append_record(record_dict)``(可选再暴露 ``flush()``)的对象,例如由 "
":func:`~agentsociety2.trace.build_local_sink` 构建的适配器。传 ``None`` 可禁用追踪。"
msgstr ""
"An object exposing ``append_record(record_dict)`` (optionally also ``flush()``), e.g. the adapter"
" built by :func:`~agentsociety2.trace.build_local_sink`. Pass ``None`` to disable tracing."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_current_time:1 of
msgid "把 society 当前时钟推送给 router 与 env 模块。"
msgstr "Push the society's current clock to the router and env modules."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_current_time:3 of
msgid ""
"这不是时间推进——society 在 ``step()`` 中推进自己的时钟并调用本方法,使 env 模块在 agent 阶段(先于 :meth:`step` 运行)观察到正确的仿真时间。部分 "
"env 模块会在 ``@tool`` 方法内读取 ``self.t`` (如事件调度、社交媒体发帖时间戳),因此时间必须在 agent 开始查询环境之前设置好。"
msgstr ""
"This is NOT time advancement — the society advances its own clock in ``step()`` and calls this so"
" that, during the agent phase (which runs before :meth:`step`), env modules observe the correct "
"simulation time. Several env modules read ``self.t`` inside ``@tool`` methods (e.g. event "
"scheduling, social-media post timestamps), so the time must be set before agents start querying "
"the environment."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:1 of
msgid "与环境交互的统一入口（由子类实现具体路由策略）。"
msgstr ""
"A unified entrance to interact with the environment (specific routing strategies are "
"implemented by subclasses)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "上下文字典。模板模式下可包含 ``variables`` ，用于 ``{var}`` 替换。"
msgstr "Context dictionary. Template mode can contain ``variables`` for ``{var}`` replacement."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:4 of
msgid "指令文本。模板模式下会进行变量替换后再执行。"
msgstr "Command text. In template mode, variables will be replaced before execution."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:5 of
msgid "是否只读（只读时应避免改变环境状态）。"
msgstr "Whether it is read-only (when reading-only, avoid changing the environment state)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:6 of
msgid "是否启用模板模式。"
msgstr "Whether to enable template mode."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:7 of
msgid "OTel trace ID（UUID hex），用于跨 agent/env 的追踪关联。"
msgstr "OTel trace ID (UUID hex) used to correlate tracing across agents and environments."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:8 of
msgid "OTel parent span ID，用于构建 span 层级。"
msgstr "OTel parent span ID used to build the span hierarchy."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.ask:9 of
msgid "``(ctx, answer)`` ，其中 ctx 可能被环境更新。"
msgstr "``(ctx, answer)``, where ctx may be updated by the environment."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.init:1 of
msgid "初始化路由器与环境模块。"
msgstr "Initialize router and environment modules."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.init:3 agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.init:3 of
msgid "仿真起始时间。"
msgstr "Simulation start time."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.init:4 of
msgid "是否有 env 模块恢复了 checkpoint（即 resume）。"
msgstr "Whether any env module restored a checkpoint, i.e. whether this is a resume."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.step:1 agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.step:1 of
msgid "推进环境模块一个仿真步。"
msgstr "Advance the environment module one simulation step."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.step:3 agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.step:3
#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.step:3 of
msgid "本步时间跨度（秒）。"
msgstr "Time span of this step (seconds)."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.step:4 agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.step:4 of
msgid "本步结束后的仿真时间。"
msgstr "The simulation time after the end of this step."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.close:1
#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CodeGenRouter.close:1 of
msgid "关闭路由器（关闭所有环境模块）。"
msgstr "Shut down the router (turn off all environment modules)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.bind_env_workspaces:1 of
msgid "把每个 env 模块绑定到 ``root/module_type``（幂等）。"
msgstr "Bind each env module to ``root/module_type`` idempotently."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.bind_env_workspaces:3 of
msgid "``module_types`` 与 ``env_modules`` 按位置对应，同时作为目录键（与 ``env_kwargs`` 对齐，避免同类多实例冲突）。"
msgstr ""
"``module_types`` and ``env_modules`` correspond by position and also act as directory keys. They "
"align with ``env_kwargs`` to avoid conflicts between multiple instances of the same class."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.from_workspaces:1 of
msgid "恢复各已绑定模块的状态（存在快照时）。"
msgstr "Restore the state of each bound module when a snapshot exists."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.from_workspaces:3 of
msgid ""
"默认严格模式：任一模块 ``restore()`` 抛错则中止整个 "
"resume（所有模块先尝试恢复、汇总失败后统一抛错，便于一次看清全部损坏点）。静默降级——失败模块以初始状态继续跑——会让模块状态与 ``SOCIETY_STEP.json`` "
"记录的步数脱钩，损坏只会在下游指标才暴露。设置 ``AGENTSOCIETY_ENV_RESTORE_ALLOW_FRESH=1`` 可恢复旧的降级行为：失败模块 fresh 启动并 ERROR"
" 汇总告警，其余模块照常恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Strict mode by default: if any module's ``restore()`` raises, the whole resume is aborted (all "
"modules first attempt to restore, failures are aggregated, then a single error is raised so all "
"corrupted points are visible at once). Silent degradation — failed modules continuing from fresh "
"state — would decouple module state from the step count recorded in ``SOCIETY_STEP.json``, so "
"corruption only surfaces in downstream metrics. Set ``AGENTSOCIETY_ENV_RESTORE_ALLOW_FRESH=1`` to"
" restore the old degraded behavior: failed modules start fresh with an aggregated ERROR-level "
"warning, while the remaining modules restore as usual."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.from_workspaces:9 of
msgid "是否有任一模块加载了快照（即 resume）。"
msgstr "Whether any module loaded a snapshot, i.e. whether this is a resume."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.from_workspaces:10 of
msgid "严格模式下存在恢复失败的模块。"
msgstr "Modules failed to restore, in strict mode."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.to_workspaces:1 of
msgid "把每个模块的动态状态写入其 workspace。"
msgstr "Write each module's dynamic state to its workspace."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.to_workspaces:3 of
msgid "用 ``return_exceptions=True`` 收集结果，单个模块落盘失败不会让本步其它模块的持久化全部丢失；收集结束后抛错，禁止提交不完整的总进度。"
msgstr ""
"Collect results with ``return_exceptions=True`` so one module's write failure does not discard "
"persistence for every other module in this step; raise after collection so an incomplete overall "
"progress is never committed."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_tool_call_history:1 of
msgid "汇总所有环境模块的工具调用历史（按时间排序）。"
msgstr "Summarize tool call history for all environment modules (sorted by time)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_tool_call_history:3 of
msgid "调用记录列表（按 ``timestamp`` 升序）。"
msgstr "Recall the record list (in ascending order by ``timestamp``)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.reset_tool_call_history:1 of
msgid "清空所有环境模块的工具调用历史。"
msgstr "Clear the tool call history of all environment modules."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_trace_context:1 of
msgid "为所有环境模块设置当前 OTel trace 上下文。"
msgstr "Set the current OTel trace context for all environment modules."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_trace_context:3 of
msgid "Router 子类应在 ``ask`` 入口处调用此方法，使 ``@tool`` 装饰器能将 ``trace_id`` 写入 tool call history。"
msgstr ""
"Router subclasses should call this method at the ``ask`` entry point so the ``@tool``"
" decorator can write ``trace_id`` into tool-call history."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_trace_context:6 of
msgid "OpenTelemetry 追踪 ID（十六进制 UUID）。"
msgstr "OpenTelemetry trace ID (hexadecimal UUID)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.clear_trace_context:1 of
msgid "清除所有环境模块的 trace 上下文。"
msgstr "Clear trace context for all environment modules."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_replay_writer:1 of
msgid "为所有环境模块设置回放写入器。"
msgstr "Set replay writers for all environment modules."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.set_replay_writer:3
#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.set_replay_writer:3 of
msgid ":class:`~agentsociety2.storage.ReplayWriter` 实例。"
msgstr ":class:`~agentsociety2.storage.ReplayWriter` Example."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_system_prompt:1 of
msgid "构建 router 侧的通用 system prompt（不含具体任务指令）。"
msgstr "Build a general system prompt on the router side (without specific task instructions)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_system_prompt:3 of
msgid "system prompt 文本。"
msgstr "system prompt text."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:1 of
msgid "封装 LLM 调度（Dispatcher 负责并发控制与 HTTP 重试）。"
msgstr "Wrap LLM dispatch; the dispatcher handles concurrency control and HTTP retries."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:3
#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:3
#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_system_prompt:3 of
msgid "``coder`` 或 ``summary`` 。"
msgstr "``coder`` or ``summary``."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:4 of
msgid "消息列表（不自动追加 system prompt；若需要请用 :meth:`acompletion_with_system_prompt` ）。"
msgstr ""
"Message list (system prompt is not automatically appended; please use "
":meth:`acompletion_with_system_prompt` if necessary)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:5 of
msgid "是否流式返回。"
msgstr "Whether to stream returns."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:6 of
msgid "可选。最大重试次数；为空则使用 ``self.max_llm_call_retry`` 。"
msgstr "Optional. Maximum number of retries; if empty, use ``self.max_llm_call_retry``."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:7 of
msgid "429 类错误的指数退避基准延迟。"
msgstr "Exponential backoff benchmark latency for class 429 errors."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:8 of
msgid "指数退避最大延迟。"
msgstr "Exponential backoff maximum delay."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:9 of
msgid "LLM 响应对象（stream=False 时为 :class:`litellm.types.utils.ModelResponse` ）。"
msgstr "LLM response object (:class:`litellm.types.utils.ModelResponse` when stream=False)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion:10 of
msgid "超过重试次数仍失败时抛出。"
msgstr "Thrown when the number of retries is exceeded and still fails."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_system_prompt:1 of
msgid "发送补全请求并自动在最前追加 router system prompt。"
msgstr ""
"Send a completion request and automatically append the router system prompt at the "
"front."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_system_prompt:4 of
msgid "消息列表。"
msgstr "Message list."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_system_prompt:5 of
msgid "LLM 响应对象。"
msgstr "LLM response object."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:1 of
msgid "发送补全并校验为指定 Pydantic 模型（失败时自动反馈并重试）。"
msgstr ""
"Send completion and verify to the specified Pydantic model (automatic feedback and "
"retry on failure)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:4 of
msgid "用于校验的 Pydantic 模型类型。"
msgstr "Pydantic model type used for validation."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:5 of
msgid "消息列表（会自动追加 system prompt）。"
msgstr "Message list (system prompt will be automatically appended)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:6 of
msgid "最大重试次数（不含首次尝试）。"
msgstr "Maximum number of retries (excluding first attempt)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:7 of
msgid "传给 LLM dispatcher 的指数退避基准延迟。"
msgstr "Base exponential-backoff delay passed to the LLM dispatcher."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:8 of
msgid "传给 LLM dispatcher 的指数退避最大延迟。"
msgstr "Maximum exponential-backoff delay passed to the LLM dispatcher."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "可选。自定义错误反馈模板（需包含 ``{error_message}`` 与 ``{model_schema}`` 占位符）。"
msgstr ""
"Optional. Customize error feedback template (need to contain ``{error_message}`` and "
"``{model_schema}`` placeholders)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:10 of
msgid "校验通过的 Pydantic 实例。"
msgstr "A Pydantic instance that passes validation."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.acompletion_with_pydantic_validation:11 of
msgid "解析/校验在重试后仍失败时抛出。"
msgstr "Thrown when parsing/verification fails after retries."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_token_usages:1 of
msgid "返回本 router 各 LLM client 聚合的 token 用量。"
msgstr "Return aggregated token usage from this router's LLM clients."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_token_usages:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "每个 dispatcher(:class:`LLMClient`)各自跟踪自己每循环的用量;此处做快照(不清零)。返回 ``{model: TokenUsageStats}`` 。"
msgstr ""
"Each dispatcher (:class:`LLMClient`) tracks its own per-loop usage; this takes a snapshot "
"(without clearing). Returns ``{model: TokenUsageStats}``."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.reset_token_usages:1 of
msgid "重置本 router 各 LLM client 上的聚合 token 用量(drain)。"
msgstr "Reset aggregated token usage on this router's LLM clients (drain)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:1 of
msgid "获取标准状态描述。"
msgstr "Get standard status descriptions."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:3 of
msgid "状态指示用户指令是否已在环境模块中有效完成,还是需要等待一段时间后由用户主动检查完成情况。"
msgstr ""
"The status indicates whether the user's instruction has been effectively completed in the "
"environment modules, or needs to wait for some time before the user actively checks completion."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:5 of
msgid ""
"状态值到描述文本的映射字典(描述文本为面向 LLM 的英文 提示词,语义如下):  - success: 任务已成功完成,所有必需操作均无错误结束。 - ``in_progress``: "
"任务仍在执行或需要更多步骤;agent 需在后续步骤检查是否完成。 - fail: 任务无法完成(如不支持的指令、数据缺失、输入无效);   需在 results 中给出详细原因。 - "
"error: 代码执行过程中发生错误;必须在 results['error'] 中包含错误详情。 - unknown: 执行状态未知"
msgstr ""
"Dictionary mapping status values to description text (the descriptions are English prompts for "
"the LLM, with the following semantics): - success: The task has been completed successfully. All "
"required operations finished without errors. - ``in_progress``: The task is still being executed "
"or more steps are needed. The agent need to check whether it is done in the next steps. - fail: "
"The task could not be completed (e.g., unsupported instruction, missing data, invalid input). "
"Include detailed reason in results. - error: An error occurred during code execution. Must "
"include error details in results['error']. - unknown: Execution status unknown"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:6 of
msgid "状态值到描述文本的映射字典(描述文本为面向 LLM 的英文 提示词,语义如下):"
msgstr ""
"Dictionary mapping status values to description text (the descriptions are English "
"prompts for the LLM, with the following semantics):"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:9 of
msgid "success: 任务已成功完成,所有必需操作均无错误结束。"
msgstr ""
"success: The task has been completed successfully. All required operations finished "
"without errors."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:9 of
msgid "``in_progress``: 任务仍在执行或需要更多步骤;agent 需在后续步骤检查是否完成。"
msgstr ""
"``in_progress``: The task is still being executed or more steps are needed. The agent need to "
"check whether it is done in the next steps."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:12 of
msgid "fail: 任务无法完成(如不支持的指令、数据缺失、输入无效); 需在 results 中给出详细原因。"
msgstr ""
"fail: The task could not be completed (e.g., unsupported instruction, missing data, "
"invalid input). Include detailed reason in results."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:12 of
msgid "error: 代码执行过程中发生错误;必须在 results['error'] 中包含错误详情。"
msgstr "error: An error occurred during code execution. Must include error details in results['error']."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_status_descriptions:16 of
msgid "unknown: 执行状态未知"
msgstr "unknown: Execution status unknown"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_world_description:1 of
msgid "获取 world description。"
msgstr "Get the world description."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_world_description_from_tools:1 of
msgid "根据环境路由器的模块信息生成简短世界描述。"
msgstr "Generate a short world description from the environment router module information."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_world_description_from_tools:3 of
msgid ""
"``world_description`` 只承担“这个仿真世界大概是什么、如何通过 ``ask_env`` 与环境交互”的轻量背景说明。模块级细节应由 env skill、工具 schema "
"或 router 自身处理，避免 world section 挤占 prompt 中 env skill 的空间。"
msgstr ""
"``world_description`` only provides lightweight background: what this simulation world roughly is"
" and how to interact with it through ``ask_env``. Module-level details should be handled by env "
"skills, tool schemas, or the router itself, so the world section does not crowd out env-skill "
"space in the prompt."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_world_description_from_tools:7 of
msgid "str: 简短世界描述文本，可直接作为 PersonAgent 的 world section"
msgstr ""
"str: The generated world description text, which can be directly used as the "
"``world_description`` parameter of PersonAgent"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_collected_pydantic_models:1 of
msgid "获取已收集的所有 Pydantic BaseModel 类型及其源代码。"
msgstr "Get all collected Pydantic BaseModel types and their source code."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_collected_pydantic_models:3 of
msgid "这些模型是在调用 ``_collect_tools_info``() 时从工具函数的参数类型和返回值类型中收集的。"
msgstr ""
"These models are collected from the parameter types and return value types of the tool functions "
"when calling ``_collect_tools_info``()."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.get_collected_pydantic_models:5 of
msgid "字典，key 是 BaseModel 类型，value 是其源代码"
msgstr "Dictionary, key is BaseModel type, value is its source code"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:1 of
msgid "根据用户输入和Router输出生成最终答案。"
msgstr "Generate the final answer based on user input and Router output."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:3 of
msgid ""
"这个方法接收用户输入（ctx, "
"instruction）和Router输出（results和过程文本），使用LLM总结为一个answer，并确定执行状态。使用JSON格式返回，通过Pydantic model验证。"
msgstr ""
"This method receives user input (ctx, instruction) and Router output (results and process text), "
"summarizes them into an answer using LLM, and determines the execution status. Returned in JSON "
"format and verified through Pydantic model."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:7 of
msgid "上下文字典，包含环境变量等信息"
msgstr "Context dictionary, containing information such as environment variables"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:8 of
msgid "用户的原始指令"
msgstr "User's original instruction"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:9 of
msgid "Router执行的结果字典"
msgstr "Dictionary of results executed by Router"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:10 of
msgid "过程文本（可选），描述执行过程的文本信息"
msgstr "Process text (optional), text information describing the execution process"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:11 of
msgid "初步的执行状态（可能被LLM更新）"
msgstr "Preliminary execution status (may be updated by LLM)"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:12 of
msgid "错误信息（如果有）"
msgstr "Error message (if any)"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.RouterBase.generate_final_answer:12 of
msgid ""
"Tuple[str, str]: (``final_answer``, ``determined_status``) - ``final_answer``: "
"LLM生成的最终答案（summary文本） - ``determined_status``: 确定的执行状态（``success/in_progress/fail/error``）"
msgstr ""
"Tuple[str, str]: (``final_answer``, ``determined_status``) - ``final_answer``: the final answer "
"generated by LLM (summary text) - ``determined_status``: determined execution status "
"(``success/in_progress/fail/error``)"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:15
msgid "EnvBase"
msgstr "EnvBase"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:1 of
msgid "环境模块基类。"
msgstr "Environment module base class."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:3 of
msgid "环境模块定义 Agent 可执行的操作和可观察的状态。通过 ``@tool`` 装饰器注册方法为可调用工具，供 Router 调用。"
msgstr ""
"The environment module defines the actions and observable states that the Agent can perform. "
"Register the method as a callable tool through the ``@tool`` decorator for Router to call."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:6 of
msgid "工具类型："
msgstr "Tool type:"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:7 of
msgid "**常规工具**: ``@tool(readonly=False)`` — 可修改环境状态"
msgstr "**Regular tools**: ``@tool(readonly=False)`` — Can modify environment state"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:8 of
msgid "**只读工具**: ``@tool(readonly=True)`` — 仅查询，不修改状态"
msgstr "**Read-only tools**: ``@tool(readonly=True)`` — Query only, does not modify state"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:9 of
msgid "**观察工具**: ``@tool(readonly=True, kind=\"observe\")`` — 自动调用"
msgstr ""
"**Observation tools**: ``@tool(readonly=True, kind=\"observe\")`` — Automatically "
"called"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:10 of
msgid "**统计工具**: ``@tool(readonly=True, kind=\"statistics\")`` — 统计信息"
msgstr ""
"**Statistics tools**: ``@tool(readonly=True, kind=\"statistics\")`` — Statistical "
"information"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:12 of
msgid "子类应实现："
msgstr "Subclasses should implement:"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:13 of
msgid "使用 ``@tool`` 装饰器定义可执行操作"
msgstr "Use the ``@tool`` decorator to define executable operations"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase:14 of
msgid "可选：实现 ``observe()`` 方法（默认收集 kind=\"observe\" 的工具）"
msgstr ""
"Optional: Implement the ``observe()`` method (tools that collect kind=\"observe\" by "
"default)"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.is_concurrency_safe:1 of
msgid "返回本模块的工具是否允许被并发调用。"
msgstr "Return whether this module's tools may be called concurrently."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.is_concurrency_safe:3 of
msgid ""
"并发安全的模块不在其工具中修改共享(跨 agent)状态,因此 router 可以不加全局 ``_execute_lock`` 执行其生成的代码,env Ray actor 也能并行扇出 "
"``ask`` 调用。默认为 ``False``(保守);只持有 per-agent 状态(以 ``agent_id`` 为键、无共享可变结构)的模块应将其覆写为 ``True`` 。"
msgstr ""
"Concurrency-safe modules do not mutate shared (cross-agent) state in their tools, so the router "
"can execute their generated code without the global ``_execute_lock`` and the env Ray actor can "
"fan out parallel ``ask`` calls. Default is ``False`` (conservative); modules that keep only per-"
"agent state (keyed by ``agent_id``, no shared mutable structures) should override it to ``True``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.is_concurrency_safe:8 of
msgid "并发调用工具安全时为 True。"
msgstr "True if concurrent tool calls are safe."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.name:1 of
msgid "环境模块名称。"
msgstr "Environment module name."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.description:1 of
msgid "返回用于 router/world 定位的模块简短描述。"
msgstr "Return a short module description for router/world orientation."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.init_description:1 of
msgid "返回本环境模块的可供 AI 阅读的初始化指引。"
msgstr "Return AI-readable initialization guidance for this environment module."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.init_description:3 of
msgid "包含类名、构造 kwargs、接受的数据形态、默认值,以及必要 时最小 kwargs 示例的 Markdown 文本。"
msgstr ""
"Markdown text with the class name, constructor kwargs, accepted data shapes, "
"defaults, and a minimal kwargs example when useful."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:1 of
msgid "返回本环境模块提供的 agent skill 所在目录。"
msgstr "Return directories containing the agent skills provided by this environment module."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:3 of
msgid "本方法使环境模块能捆绑 agent 在该环境中操作时应使用的专用 skill。 skill 通过扫描返回目录中的 SKILL.md 文件来发现。"
msgstr ""
"This method lets environment modules bundle specialized skills that agents should use"
" when operating in that environment. Skills are discovered by scanning the returned "
"directories for SKILL.md files."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:6 of
msgid "**默认发现约定：**"
msgstr "**Default Discovery Convention:**"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:8 of
msgid "基类实现自动从以下位置发现 skill:"
msgstr "The base implementation automatically discovers skills from:"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:10 of
msgid "包模块(如 ``mobility_space/__init__.py``): 扫描 ``<module_dir>/agent_skills/`` 目录。"
msgstr ""
"Package modules (e.g., ``mobility_space/__init__.py``): Scans the "
"``<module_dir>/agent_skills/`` directory."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:13 of
msgid "单文件模块(如 ``economy_space.py``): 扫描 ``<module_dir>/<stem>_agent_skills/`` 目录。"
msgstr ""
"Single-file modules (e.g., ``economy_space.py``): Scans the "
"``<module_dir>/<stem>_agent_skills/`` directory."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:16 of
msgid "**自定义路径时覆写：**"
msgstr "**Override for Custom Paths:**"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:18 of
msgid "子类可覆写本方法以指定自定义 skill 目录::"
msgstr "Subclasses can override this method to specify custom skill directories::"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:20 of
msgid ""
"@classmethod\n"
"def skill_dirs(cls) -> list[Path]:\n"
"    from pathlib import Path\n"
"    skills_dir = Path(__file__).parent.parent / \"skills\"\n"
"    return [skills_dir] if skills_dir.is_dir() else []"
msgstr ""
"@classmethod\n"
"def skill_dirs(cls) -> list[Path]:\n"
"    from pathlib import Path\n"
"    skills_dir = Path(__file__).parent.parent / \"skills\"\n"
"    return [skills_dir] if skills_dir.is_dir() else []"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:26 of
msgid "**skill 目录结构：**"
msgstr "**Skill Directory Structure:**"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:28 of
msgid ""
"每个 skill 目录应包含带 SKILL.md 文件的子目录,例如 ``agent_skills/navigation/SKILL.md`` 及可选的 "
"``agent_skills/navigation/scripts/`` 。"
msgstr ""
"Each skill directory should contain subdirectories with SKILL.md files, for example "
"``agent_skills/navigation/SKILL.md`` and optional "
"``agent_skills/navigation/scripts/``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.skill_dirs:32 of
msgid "指向含 skill 子目录的目录的 Path 对象列表。无 skill 时 为空列表。"
msgstr ""
"List of Path objects pointing to directories containing skill subdirectories. Empty "
"list if no skills are provided."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.init:1 of
msgid "初始化环境模块。"
msgstr "Initialize the environment module."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.step:5 of
msgid "基类不提供默认实现。"
msgstr "The base class does not provide a default implementation."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.close:1 of
msgid "关闭环境模块并释放资源（可选重写）。"
msgstr "Closes the environment module and releases resources (optional override)."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.to_workspace:1 of
msgid "把动态状态写入 workspace（每步由 society 经 router 调用）。"
msgstr ""
"Write dynamic state to the workspace; called by society through the router on each "
"step."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.to_workspace:3 of
msgid ""
"默认 no-op。子类按自选的格式/文件名把需要跨重启保留的状态写到 ``self._workspace_root`` （或传入的 ``workspace_path`` "
"）下。建议用 :func:`~agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text` 原子写。"
msgstr ""
"The default implementation is a no-op. Subclasses write restart-persistent state "
"under ``self._workspace_root`` (or the provided ``workspace_path``) using their "
"chosen format and file name. Use "
":func:`~agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text` for atomic writes."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.restore:1 of
msgid "从 workspace 恢复动态状态（resume 路径）。"
msgstr "Restore dynamic state from the workspace on the resume path."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.restore:3 of
msgid ""
"默认返回 ``False`` 。子类读取自己写入的状态并还原；返回是否成功加载（供 router 区分 fresh / resume）。仅在 ``__init__`` 与 ``init()`` "
"之后调用，故可安全覆盖 ``init()`` 设置的字段。"
msgstr ""
"The default implementation returns ``False``. Subclasses read and restore the state they wrote, "
"and return whether a snapshot was loaded so the router can distinguish fresh startup from resume."
" This is called only after ``__init__`` and ``init()``, so it can safely override fields set by "
"``init()``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.from_workspace:1 of
msgid "从 workspace 重建就绪模块：``cls(**init_kwargs)`` 后 ``restore`` 。"
msgstr ""
"Rebuild a ready module from a workspace: ``cls(**init_kwargs)`` followed by "
"``restore``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.from_workspace:3 of
msgid "构造该模块用的 kwargs（resume 时由 actor 从 ``SOCIETY.json`` 取）。"
msgstr ""
"Keyword arguments used to construct the module; during resume the actor reads them "
"from ``SOCIETY.json``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.get_tool_call_history:1 of
msgid "获取工具调用历史（浅拷贝）。"
msgstr "Get tool call history (shallow copy)."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.get_tool_call_history:3 of
msgid ""
"调用记录列表。每条包含 ``function_name`` 、``kwargs`` 、``return_value`` 、 ``exception_occurred`` "
"、``exception_info`` 、``timestamp`` 。"
msgstr ""
"Call record list. Each entry contains ``function_name``, ``kwargs``, "
"``return_value``, ``exception_occurred``, ``exception_info``, ``timestamp``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.reset_tool_call_history:1 of
msgid "清空工具调用历史。"
msgstr "Clear tool call history."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase.set_replay_writer:1 of
msgid "设置回放写入器（用于自动建表与写入状态）。"
msgstr "Set the playback writer (for automatic table creation and writing status)."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:23
msgid "工具装饰器"
msgstr "Tool decorator"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:1 of
msgid "将环境方法注册为可调用工具（供 Router/LLM 调用）。"
msgstr "Register an environment method as a callable tool for the router and LLM."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:3 of
msgid "是否只读。 当 ``kind`` 为 ``observe`` 或 ``statistics`` 时必须为 ``True`` （运行时强校验）。"
msgstr ""
"Whether the tool is read-only. Must be ``True`` when ``kind`` is ``observe`` or ``statistics``; "
"enforced at runtime."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:5 of
msgid "可选。工具名（默认使用函数名）。"
msgstr "Optional tool name; defaults to the function name."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:6 of
msgid "可选。工具描述（用于模型函数调用 schema）。"
msgstr "Optional tool description used in the model's function-calling schema."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:7 of
msgid ""
"可选。工具类型：  - ``observe`` ：观测工具（通常每步自动调用），除 ``self`` 外最多 1 个参数 - ``statistics`` ：统计工具，除 ``self`` "
"外不能有参数 - ``None`` ：普通工具"
msgstr ""
"Optional tool kind: - ``observe``: observation tool, usually invoked each step, with at most one "
"parameter besides ``self`` - ``statistics``: statistics tool, with no parameters besides ``self``"
" - ``None``: regular tool"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:7 of
msgid "可选。工具类型："
msgstr "Optional tool kind:"

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:9 of
msgid "``observe`` ：观测工具（通常每步自动调用），除 ``self`` 外最多 1 个参数"
msgstr "``observe``: Observation tool, usually invoked each step; at most one parameter besides ``self``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:10 of
msgid "``statistics`` ：统计工具，除 ``self`` 外不能有参数"
msgstr "``statistics``: Statistics tool; no parameters besides ``self``."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:11 of
msgid "``None`` ：普通工具"
msgstr "``None``: Regular tool."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:12 of
msgid "装饰器函数。"
msgstr "Decorator function."

#: agentsociety2.env.base.tool:13 of
msgid "``kind`` 与 ``readonly``/参数签名不匹配时抛出。"
msgstr "Raised when ``kind`` conflicts with ``readonly`` or the parameter signature."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:23
msgid "TokenUsageStats"
msgstr "TokenUsageStats"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.TokenUsageStats:1 of
msgid "模型 token 用量统计。"
msgstr "Token usage statistics for a model."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst
msgid "变量"
msgstr "Variables"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.TokenUsageStats:3 of
msgid "API 调用次数。"
msgstr "Number of API calls made."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.TokenUsageStats:4 of
msgid "消耗的输入 token 总数。"
msgstr "Total number of input tokens consumed."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.TokenUsageStats:5 of
msgid "消耗的输出 token 总数。"
msgstr "Total number of output tokens consumed."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.TokenUsageStats:6 of
msgid "由 provider 的提示词前缀缓存服务的输入 token(``input_tokens`` 的子集)。"
msgstr ""
"Input tokens served by the provider's prompt-prefix cache (a subset of "
"``input_tokens``)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_base.TokenUsageStats.cache_hit_rate:1 of
msgid "返回 ``cached_input_tokens / input_tokens``,截断到 ``[0, 1]`` 区间。"
msgstr "Returns ``cached_input_tokens / input_tokens``, clamped to the ``[0, 1]`` range."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:30
msgid "CacheStats"
msgstr "CacheStats"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats:1 of
msgid "缓存统计信息"
msgstr "Cache statistics"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats.cache_hit_rate:1 of
msgid "缓存命中率"
msgstr "Cache hit rate"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats.code_execution_success_rate:1 of
msgid "代码执行成功率"
msgstr "Code execution success rate"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats.avg_input_tokens:1 of
msgid "平均输入token数"
msgstr "Average input token count"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats.avg_output_tokens:1 of
msgid "平均输出token数"
msgstr "Average output token count"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats.avg_retry_count:1 of
msgid "平均代码重试次数"
msgstr "Average code retry count"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats.to_dict:1 of
msgid "导出可序列化的统计快照(供落盘与归档)。"
msgstr "Export a serializable statistics snapshot (for persistence and archiving)."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_codegen.CacheStats.to_dict:3 of
msgid "全部计数字段与派生比率。"
msgstr "All counter fields and derived ratios."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:37
msgid "内置路由器"
msgstr "Built-in router"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:40
msgid "ReActRouter"
msgstr "ReActRouter"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_react.ReActRouter:1 of
msgid "ReAct模式Router：通过Reasoning-Acting循环，使用function calling直接调用所有模块的所有函数。"
msgstr ""
"ReAct mode Router: Through the Reasoning-Acting loop, use function calling to "
"directly call all functions of all modules."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_react.ReActRouter:3 of
msgid ""
"工作流程： 1. 收集所有环境模块的工具信息 2. 使用LLM的function calling能力选择并调用工具 3. 执行工具调用，获取结果 4. 将结果反馈给LLM"
"，继续下一轮Reasoning-Acting循环 5. 直到LLM判断任务完成或达到最大步数"
msgstr ""
"Workflow: 1. Collect tool information of all environment modules 2. Use LLM's "
"function calling capability to select and call tools 3. Execute tool calls and obtain"
" results 4. Feed back the results to LLM and continue the next Reasoning-Acting cycle"
" 5. Until LLM determines that the task is completed or the maximum number of steps is"
" reached"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_react.ReActRouter.ask:1 of
msgid "使用ReAct模式处理指令。"
msgstr "Use ReAct mode to process instructions."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_plan_execute.PlanExecuteRouter.ask:3
#: agentsociety2.env.router_react.ReActRouter.ask:3
#: agentsociety2.env.router_search_tool.SearchToolRouter.ask:3
#: agentsociety2.env.router_two_tier_plan_execute.TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter.ask:3
#: agentsociety2.env.router_two_tier_react.TwoTierReActRouter.ask:3 of
msgid "上下文字典"
msgstr "context dictionary"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_plan_execute.PlanExecuteRouter.ask:4
