#: agentsociety2.env.router_plan_execute.PlanExecuteRouter:1 of
msgid "Plan-and-Execute模式Router：先制定计划，然后执行计划中的步骤。"
msgstr ""
"Plan-and-Execute mode Router: first make a plan, and then execute the steps in the "
"plan."

#: agentsociety2.env.router_plan_execute.PlanExecuteRouter:3 of
msgid "工作流程： 1. 收集所有环境模块的工具信息 2. 第一阶段：使用LLM制定执行计划（不调用工具） 3. 第二阶段：按照计划逐步执行工具调用 4. 根据执行结果生成最终答案"
msgstr ""
"Workflow: 1. Collect tool information from all environment modules 2. Phase 1: Use "
"LLM to develop an execution plan (without calling tools) 3. Phase 2: Execute tool "
"calls step by step according to the plan 4. Generate the final answer based on the "
"execution results"

#: agentsociety2.env.router_plan_execute.PlanExecuteRouter.ask:1 of
