#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:88
msgid "环境路由 Actor"
msgstr "Environment Router Actor"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:90
msgid ""
"生产环境下环境路由跑在一个专用的 Ray actor 里（由 ``get_env_router_actor_class`` 动态创建）， agent 通过 "
"``EnvRouterProxy`` 句柄与之交互。"
msgstr ""
"In production, environment routing runs in a dedicated Ray actor, dynamically created"
" by ``get_env_router_actor_class``; agents interact with it through an "
"``EnvRouterProxy`` handle."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/env.rst:94
msgid "EnvRouterProxy"
msgstr "EnvRouterProxy"

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy:1 of
msgid "面向 agent/society 的句柄,委托给持有 env router 的 Ray actor。"
msgstr "Agent/society-facing handle delegating to the Ray actor that holds the env router."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"与进程内 router 不同,本 proxy 不持有具体的 env 模块实例(它们位于 actor 进程中),因此无法暴露 ``env_modules`` 。为了让 "
"agent 侧仍能发现 env 提供的 skill,proxy 携带 ``env_skill_dirs``——构造时从 registry 解析出的全部已配置 env 模块"
" ``skill_dirs()`` 的并集,每项配对模块类名 (用作 ``env:{ClassName}`` "
"命名空间)。``AgentBase.discover_skill_sources`` 在 ``env_modules`` 之外还会读取该属性,因此无论 agent "
"看到的是真实 router 还是本 proxy,env skill 都可见。该属性是纯 JSON 可序列化数据 (``list[(str, str)]``),proxy "
"仍能干净地跨越 Ray 边界。"
msgstr ""
"Unlike the in-process router, this proxy does NOT hold concrete env-module instances "
"(they live in the actor's process), so it cannot expose ``env_modules``. To keep env-"
"provided skills discoverable from the agent side, the proxy carries "
"``env_skill_dirs`` — the union of every configured env module's ``skill_dirs()`` "
"resolved from the registry at construction time, each paired with the module's class "
"name (used as the ``env:{ClassName}`` namespace). "
"``AgentBase.discover_skill_sources`` reads this attribute in addition to "
"``env_modules``, so env skills are visible regardless of whether the agent sees a "
"real router or this proxy. The attribute is plain JSON-serializable data "
"(``list[(str, str)]``), so the proxy still crosses the Ray boundary cleanly."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.set_current_time:1 of
msgid "把 society 时钟转发给 actor(fire-and-forget)。"
msgstr "Forward the society clock to the actor (fire-and-forget)."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.set_current_time:3 of
msgid "参见 :meth:`RouterBase.set_current_time`——推送 society 当前时间, 使 env 模块在 agent 阶段能观察到它。"
msgstr ""
"See :meth:`RouterBase.set_current_time` — pushes the society's current time so env "
"modules observe it during the agent phase."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.set_replay_writer:1 of
msgid "把回放 writer/proxy 转发给 actor(fire-and-forget)。"
msgstr "Forward a replay writer/proxy to the actor (fire-and-forget)."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.set_replay_writer:3 of
msgid ""
"env actor 通常在构造时即获得其回放 proxy(使 env 模块与 agent 共享 同一回放目录)。本方法允许调用方在构造之后额外/另行注入 writer;经"
" ``set_replay_writer`` 转发给 actor。``ReplayProxy`` 可序列化,能干净 地跨越 Ray 边界。"
msgstr ""
"The env actor normally receives its replay proxy at construction (so env modules and "
"agents share the same replay directory). This method lets a caller "
"additionally/alternatively inject a writer after construction; it is forwarded to the"
" actor via ``set_replay_writer``. A ``ReplayProxy`` is serializable, so it travels "
"across the Ray boundary cleanly."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.ask:1 of
msgid "把 env ask 转发给 actor 并等待 ``(ctx, answer)`` 结果。"
msgstr "Forward an env ask to the actor and await the ``(ctx, answer)`` result."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.to_workspaces:1 of
msgid "转发每步 env 状态持久化到 actor。"
msgstr "Forward per-step env state persistence to the actor."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.from_workspaces:1 of
msgid "转发 env 状态恢复（resume）到 actor。"
msgstr "Forward env state restoration (resume) to the actor."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_proxy.EnvRouterProxy.get_token_usages:1 of
msgid "返回 env router(coder/summary)token 用量快照。"
msgstr "Return the env router (coder/summary) token usage snapshot."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_actor.get_env_router_actor_class:1 of
msgid "返回 Ray env-router actor 类(每个 ``max_concurrency`` 只创建一次)。"
msgstr "Return the Ray env-router actor class (created once per ``max_concurrency``)."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_actor.get_env_router_actor_class:3 of
msgid ""
"Ray actor 并发度。``1`` 串行化 ask 调用(任一 env 模块非并发安全时的默认值);``>1`` 仅当所有 env 模块声明 "
"``is_concurrency_safe()`` 时才允许并行 async ask 调用。"
msgstr ""
"Ray actor concurrency. ``1`` serializes ask calls (the default when any env module is"
" not concurrency-safe); ``>1`` allows parallel async ask calls only when all env "
"modules declare ``is_concurrency_safe()``."

#: agentsociety2.env.env_router_actor.get_env_router_actor_class:6 of
msgid "一个 Ray actor 类(``@ray.remote(max_concurrency=...)``)。"
msgstr "A Ray actor class (``@ray.remote(max_concurrency=...)``)."

