#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/runtime.rst:2
msgid "共享服务与追踪"
msgstr "Shared services and tracing"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/runtime.rst:4
msgid ""
"本页补充智能体、路由与存储接口共同使用的运行时类型。系统中的连接方式见 :doc:`/architecture`；一般实验优先使用 :doc:`society` "
"的编排器入口。"
msgstr ""
"This page covers runtime types shared by agent, router, and storage interfaces. See "
":doc:`/architecture` for their connections; most experiments should use the "
"orchestrator in :doc:`society`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/runtime.rst:7
msgid "服务容器"
msgstr "Service container"

#: agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy.ServiceProxy:1 of
msgid "所有共享服务句柄的一站式容器。"
msgstr "Container for all shared service handles."

#: agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy.ServiceProxy:3 of
msgid ""
"``from_workspace(path, service_proxy)`` 只接收本对象。所有字段都是 可序列化句柄(LLM client、env "
"router、可选的 trace 与 replay proxy), 因此该容器可跨 Ray Task 边界传输。"
msgstr ""
"``from_workspace(path, service_proxy)`` receives this object. All fields are "
"serializable handles: LLM clients, an environment router, and optional trace and "
"replay proxies. The container can therefore cross Ray task boundaries."

#: agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy.ServiceProxy:7 of
msgid ""
"``llm`` client 只携带连接参数(不含活跃的 Router/semaphore),每个接收 反序列化副本的 Ray Task / actor 会在首次 "
"``call()`` 时重建自己的按事件 循环的运行时。:meth:`take_token_stats` 排空按任务的 token 使用增量, 使 Ray Task "
"能把它带回返回值中(无 actor,无模块级全局聚合)。"
msgstr ""
"LLM clients carry connection parameters without a live Router or semaphore. Each "
"deserialized Ray task or actor rebuilds its event-loop runtime on the first "
"``call()``. :meth:`take_token_stats` drains task-local usage deltas for inclusion in "
"task return values, without an actor or module-global aggregation."

#: agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy.ServiceProxy.take_token_stats:1 of
msgid "排空并返回本 proxy 各 LLM client 的 token 用量(增量)。"
msgstr "Drain and return token usage deltas from this proxy’s LLM clients."

#: agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy.ServiceProxy.take_token_stats:3 of
msgid "在 Ray Task 结束时调用,以便把增量并入其返回值。每个 ``LLMClient`` 自行清零统计,因此复用的 worker 进程不会跨任务重复计数。"
msgstr ""
"Called at the end of a Ray task to merge deltas into its return value. Each "
"``LLMClient`` resets its counters so reused workers do not count usage twice across "
"tasks."

#: agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy.LLMClients:1 of
msgid "按角色组织的 LLM client 集合。"
msgstr "LLM clients organized by role."

#: agentsociety2.agent.service_proxy.LLMClients:3 of
msgid "Agent 使用 ``default``,env router 使用 ``coder`` / ``default`` 。"
msgstr "Agents use ``default``; environment routers use ``coder`` / ``default``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/runtime.rst:18
msgid "LLM 连接与并发"
msgstr "LLM connections and concurrency"

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.LLMClient:1 of
msgid "可序列化的 LLM 连接配置,按事件循环构建自己的运行时。"
msgstr "Serializable LLM connection configuration with an event-loop-local runtime."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.LLMClient:3 of
msgid ""
"携带原始连接参数(``model_name``/``base_url``/``api_key``)以跨 Ray task 边界。在某个事件循环里首次 ``call()``"
" 时,构建自己的 litellm ``Router`` 与 :class:`AdaptiveSemaphore` (两者都是绑定该循环的 asyncio "
"对象),缓存在实例 上,且 **运行循环改变时重建** 。 ``__getstate__`` 剥离运行时,使每个反序列化 "
"副本都在自己的循环里全新构建——没有模块级缓存,没有跨事件循环绑定。"
msgstr ""
"Carries ``model_name``, ``base_url``, and ``api_key`` across Ray task boundaries. The"
" first ``call()`` on an event loop creates and caches a LiteLLM ``Router`` and "
":class:`AdaptiveSemaphore`, both bound to that loop. **The runtime is rebuilt when "
"the loop changes.** ``__getstate__`` removes runtime objects so each deserialized "
"copy starts fresh, without a module-level cache or cross-loop binding."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.LLMClient:9 of
msgid "token 用量累积在实例级 dict 中,经 :meth:`take_token_stats` 取走(通过 Ray Task 返回值带回)。"
msgstr ""
"Token usage accumulates in an instance dictionary and is drained by "
":meth:`take_token_stats` for return from Ray tasks."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.LLMClient.take_token_stats:1 of
msgid "返回并清空本 client 的 token 统计(一份增量)。"
msgstr "Return and reset this client’s token usage counters as a delta."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.LLMClient.call:1 of
msgid "发送补全请求,带按循环的 AIMD 门控与重试。"
msgstr "Send a completion request with event-loop-local AIMD gating and retries."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.LLMClient.call:3 of
msgid ""
"``thinking`` 在此消费、绝不转发: ``\"inherit\"`` (默认)应用本 client 的 角色级 "
":class:`ThinkingSettings` ，``\"on\"`` 与 ``\"off\"`` 则为本次调用 "
"发送显式指令。内置工具调用继承所配置的策略,使必须思考的模型在未选择 关闭策略时仍可用。"
msgstr ""
"``thinking`` is consumed here and never forwarded directly. ``\"inherit\"`` (the "
"default) applies this client’s role-specific :class:`ThinkingSettings`; ``\"on\"`` "
"and ``\"off\"`` provide explicit overrides for this call. Built-in tools inherit the "
"configured policy, allowing models that require thinking when it has not been "
"explicitly disabled."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.LLMClient.call:8 of
msgid ""
"调用方在 ``kwargs`` 里传入的 ``reasoning_effort`` / ``extra_body`` 会 **整体替换** "
"角色级取值——不做深合并,因此实际发送内容始终可预测。"
msgstr ""
"``reasoning_effort`` / ``extra_body`` provided through ``kwargs`` **replace** role-"
"level values rather than deeply merging them, making outgoing parameters predictable."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.AdaptiveSemaphore:1 of
msgid "TCP 风格的 AIMD 自适应并发信号量(每进程一个)。"
msgstr "TCP-style AIMD adaptive concurrency semaphore, one per process."

#: agentsociety2.config.llm_dispatcher.AdaptiveSemaphore:3 of
msgid ""
"``max_limit=None`` 表示不设上限——AIMD(加性增/乘性减)自由探测,没有人为 封顶,靠延迟变慢与限流错误来退避。LLM I/O 这类远端 API "
"才是真实天花板的 场景应这样用;CPU/本地工作不得压垮单进程时,请传入有限的 ``max_limit`` 。"
msgstr ""
"``max_limit=None`` removes the artificial upper limit. AIMD (additive increase, "
"multiplicative decrease) probes concurrency and backs off as latency or rate limits "
"worsen. Use this for remote LLM I/O; provide a finite ``max_limit`` for CPU or local "
"work that must not overload one process."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/runtime.rst:31
msgid "追踪句柄与写入"
msgstr "Trace handles and writing"

#: agentsociety2.trace.span.TraceSpan:1 of
msgid "保存 OpenTelemetry 兼容字段的运行时追踪片段（span）。"
msgstr "Runtime trace span with OpenTelemetry-compatible fields."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.JsonlTraceWriter:1 of
msgid "通过分片写入器记录 OpenTelemetry 兼容的 JSONL 追踪片段。"
msgstr "Write OpenTelemetry-compatible JSONL spans through a sharded sink."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.JsonlTraceWriter:3 of
msgid "完成的片段发送到 ``sharded_writer``；生产环境通常使用 :class:`ShardedAppendSink`。当写入器为 ``None`` 时仍可创建片段，但不会保存记录。"
msgstr ""
"Completed spans are sent to ``sharded_writer``, typically a :class:`ShardedAppendSink`. When the "
"writer is ``None``, spans can still be created but records are not saved."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.JsonlTraceWriter:5 of
msgid "所属智能体的 ID。"
msgstr "ID of the agent that owns this writer."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.JsonlTraceWriter:7 of
msgid "OpenTelemetry 的 ``resource.service.name`` 字段。"
msgstr "OpenTelemetry ``resource.service.name`` field."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.JsonlTraceWriter:9 of
msgid "OpenTelemetry 的 ``scope.name`` 字段。"
msgstr "OpenTelemetry ``scope.name`` field."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.JsonlTraceWriter:11 of
msgid "OpenTelemetry 的 ``scope.version`` 字段。"
msgstr "OpenTelemetry ``scope.version`` field."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.JsonlTraceWriter:13 of
msgid "底层写入器；为 ``None`` 时不保存记录。"
msgstr "Underlying sink; ``None`` disables record storage."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.ShardedAppendSink:1 of
msgid "按 ``trace_id[:2]`` 分片的 JSONL 追踪写入器，最多生成 256 个分片文件。"
msgstr "Append-only JSONL trace sink sharded by ``trace_id[:2]``, with at most 256 shard files."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.ShardedAppendSink:3 of
msgid ""
"每个进程维护自己的实例，通过 ``os.open(O_APPEND)`` 和 ``os.write`` 追加记录，不需要集中式 "
"actor。分片数量不随智能体数量增加；并发追加的行为取决于底层文件系统，管道的 ``PIPE_BUF`` 原子写入保证不适用于普通文件。"
msgstr ""
"Each process owns its instance and appends through ``os.open(O_APPEND)`` and ``os.write`` without"
" a central actor. The shard count does not grow with the agent count. Concurrent append behavior "
"depends on the filesystem; pipe-specific ``PIPE_BUF`` atomic-write guarantees do not apply to "
"regular files."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.ShardedAppendSink:5 of
