msgstr ""
"``_cap_large`` truncates oversized strings to reduce trace payloads. It limits individual values,"
" not the total encoded size of a record."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.TraceProxy:1 of
msgid "分布式追踪的可序列化配置。"
msgstr "Serializable configuration for distributed tracing."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.TraceProxy:3 of
msgid ""
"仅保存输出目录 ``trace_dir``，不携带 Ray actor 句柄。智能体、环境路由和驱动进程分别创建本地 :class:`ShardedAppendSink` "
"并直接写入；``trace_dir`` 为 ``None`` 时不记录追踪数据。"
msgstr ""
"Carries only the output directory, ``trace_dir``, without a Ray actor handle. Agents, environment"
" routers, and drivers each create a local :class:`ShardedAppendSink` and write directly. ``None``"
" disables tracing."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.build_local_sink:1 of
msgid "根据 :class:`TraceProxy` 创建当前进程的 :class:`ShardedAppendSink`。"
msgstr "Create a per-process :class:`ShardedAppendSink` from a :class:`TraceProxy`."

#: agentsociety2.trace.sharded_writer.build_local_sink:3 of
msgid "未设置 ``trace_dir`` 时返回 ``None``，表示追踪功能已关闭。"
msgstr "Return ``None`` when ``trace_dir`` is unset, indicating that tracing is disabled."

