"This module provides the entry points for research workflows and analysis tooling, "
"supporting a complete research process:"

#: agentsociety2.skills:6 of
msgid "技能列表"
msgstr "Skill List"

#: agentsociety2.skills:8 of
msgid "**literature**: 学术文献搜索与管理，支持检索、索引和格式化"
msgstr ""
"**literature**: academic literature search and management, including retrieval, "
"indexing, and formatting"

#: agentsociety2.skills:9 of
