#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_id:3 of
msgid ""
"接受 registry skill id(``namespace@name``)或裸显示名 ``name`` ——本 runtime 的每个公开 skill API 都取同样的 "
"``token`` 并兼容两种形式。``visible_only`` 为 True(默认)时解析限于可见 skill; 为 False 时搜索整个 registry(用于尚未可见的 "
"skill,如 :meth:`set_visible_skills` 中)。"
msgstr ""
"Accepts either a registry skill id (``namespace@name``) or a bare display ``name`` — every public"
" skill API in this runtime takes the same ``token`` and tolerates both forms. When "
"``visible_only`` is True (the default), resolution is restricted to visible skills; when False, "
"the whole registry is searched (used for skills not yet visible, e.g. in "
":meth:`set_visible_skills`)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_id:8 of
