#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_path:1 of
msgid "将一个路径映射为可见 skill 内的 ``(skill_id, relative_path)`` 。"
msgstr "Map a path to a ``(skill_id, relative_path)`` inside a visible skill."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_path:3 of
msgid ""
"用于兜底恢复:agent 经由通用 workspace ``read`` 工具尝试 ``read`` 一个 skill 内嵌文件(如 "
"``references/examples.md``)时,该工具只能看到 agent workspace,会把这类路径当作\"越界\"拒绝。返回映射使调用方可以透明转交给 "
":meth:`read_skill_file`,而非直接失败。"
msgstr ""
"Used as a fallback: when an agent tries to ``read`` a skill-bundled file (e.g. "
"``references/examples.md``) via the generic workspace ``read`` tool, that tool only sees the "
"agent workspace and rejects such paths as \"escaping\" it. Returning a mapping lets the caller "
"transparently delegate to :meth:`read_skill_file` instead of failing."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_path:8 of
msgid "两种匹配策略,按顺序:"
msgstr "Two matching strategies, in order:"

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_path:10 of
msgid "直接包含——解析后的绝对路径位于某个可见 skill 根目录内。"
msgstr "Direct containment — the resolved absolute path is inside a visible skill root."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_path:9 of
msgid ""
"skill 名段——某个路径分量等于某个可见 skill 的 ``skill_id`` 或 ``name``(如模型生成的 ``.../skills/daily-"
"guidance/references/examples.md``)。该段之后的分量被当作 skill 相对路径,且必须能解析到 skill 根下确实存在的文件。"
msgstr ""
"Skill-name segment — some path component equals a visible skill's ``skill_id`` or ``name`` (e.g. "
"the model-emitted ``.../skills/daily-guidance/references/examples.md``). The components after "
"that segment are taken as the skill-relative path and must resolve to an existing file under the "
"skill root."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_path:17 of
msgid "待测试路径(绝对路径,或按段匹配的相对路径)。"
msgstr "Path to test (absolute, or relative to be matched by segment)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.AgentSkillRuntime.resolve_skill_path:18 of
msgid "命中可见 skill 文件时为 ``(skill_id, posix_relative_path)``, 否则为 ``None`` 。"
msgstr "``(skill_id, posix_relative_path)`` when a visible skill file matches, else ``None``."

