#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/skills.rst:81
msgid "SkillScriptContext"
msgstr "SkillScriptContext"

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_script_context.SkillScriptContext:1 of
msgid "每次调用传给进程内 skill ``entrypoint`` 的上下文。"
msgstr "Per-call context handed to an in-process skill ``entrypoint``."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_script_context.SkillScriptContext:3 of
msgid ""
"取代 subprocess 路径依赖的进程级环境变量(``AGENT_WORK_DIR`` 等), 使 50 个 agent 能在进程内并行运行各自的 hook,而不会在"
" ``os.environ`` / ``cwd`` / ``sys.stdout`` 上竞争。"
msgstr ""
"Replaces the process-global env vars (``AGENT_WORK_DIR`` etc.) the subprocess path "
"relied on, so 50 agents can run their hooks in-process in parallel without racing on "
"``os.environ`` / ``cwd`` / ``sys.stdout``."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_script_context.SkillScriptContext:7 of
msgid "本 agent 的 workspace 根目录(原 ``AGENT_WORK_DIR``)。"
msgstr "This agent's workspace root (was ``AGENT_WORK_DIR``)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_script_context.SkillScriptContext:8 of
