msgstr "Registry skill id (was ``SKILL_ID``)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_script_context.SkillScriptContext:10 of
msgid "显示名(原 ``SKILL_NAME``)。"
msgstr "Display name (was ``SKILL_NAME``)."

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_script_context.SkillScriptContext:11 of
msgid "subprocess 路径原本会设置的环境变量字典快照。"
msgstr "Snapshot of the env-var dict the subprocess path would have set."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/skills.rst:88
msgid "脚本返回类型与注册表协议"
msgstr "Script results and registry protocol"

#: agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_runtime.ScriptRunResult:1 of
