#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/skills.rst:99
msgid "SKILL.md Frontmatter"
msgstr "SKILL.md Frontmatter"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/skills.rst:101
msgid "SKILL.md 文件使用 YAML frontmatter 声明 skill 元信息："
msgstr "The SKILL.md file uses YAML frontmatter to declare skill metainformation:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/skills.rst:103
msgid ""
"---\n"
"name: my-skill\n"
"description: 触发条件 + 输出结果，选择阶段 LLM 唯一可见的文本\n"
"script: scripts/my_skill.py\n"
"hooks:\n"
"  pre_step: scripts/my_skill.py\n"
"---"
msgstr ""
"---\n"
"name: my-skill\n"
"description: Trigger conditions and expected output; the only text visible to the LLM during "
"selection\n"
"script: scripts/my_skill.py\n"
"hooks:\n"
"  pre_step: scripts/my_skill.py\n"
"---"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/skills.rst:113
msgid ""
"frontmatter 之后识别的字段：``name``、``description``（选择阶段唯一可见，决定是否激活）、可选的 ``script``（默认脚本相对路径）与 "
"``hooks``（生命周期脚本映射，键如 ``pre_step`` / ``post_step``）。Skill 注册 id 形如 ``namespace@name``（内置 ``built-"
"in@``、自定义 ``custom@``）。内置脚本在 agent 进程内经 ``entrypoint(argv, ctx)`` 执行，自定义脚本经 ``skill_worker.py`` "
"隔离子进程执行（详见 :doc:`/agent_skills`）；以 ``env:`` 开头的 skill id 会被重定向到 ``ask_env``，走环境路由而非脚本。"
msgstr ""
"Recognized frontmatter fields: ``name`` and ``description`` (visible during selection and "
"determining activation), optional ``script`` (relative path to the default script), and ``hooks``"
" (lifecycle scripts keyed by names such as ``pre_step`` / ``post_step``). Skill registration IDs "
"use ``namespace@name`` (``built-in@`` for built-in skills and ``custom@`` for custom skills). "
"Built-in scripts execute in the agent process through ``entrypoint(argv, ctx)``; custom scripts "
"execute in isolated ``skill_worker.py`` subprocesses (see :doc:`/agent_skills`). Skill IDs "
"starting with ``env:`` are redirected to ``ask_env`` through the environment router rather than a"
" script."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/society.rst:2
msgid "Society 模块"
msgstr "Society Module"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/society.rst:4
msgid "本页用于查编排器的初始化、时间推进、查询与干预接口。按配置文件运行实验见 :doc:`/cli`，交互片段见 :doc:`/interaction`。"
msgstr ""
"Look up orchestration initialization, time advancement, queries and interventions "
"here. Run configuration files with :doc:`/cli`; interaction examples are in "
":doc:`/interaction`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/society.rst:7
msgid "AgentSociety"
msgstr "AgentSociety"

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety:1 of
msgid "Record-based 仿真编排器（不持有 agent 对象）。"
msgstr "Record-based simulation orchestrator that does not hold agent objects."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety:3 of
msgid "AgentSociety 是框架的核心类，负责管理仿真生命周期："
msgstr ""
"AgentSociety is the core class of the framework and is responsible for managing the "
"simulation life cycle:"

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety:5 of
msgid "持有 ``agent_specs`` （元数据含 id / profile / config）与 ``agent_ids``，绝不在主进程常驻 agent 对象。"
msgstr ""
"Holds ``agent_specs`` (metadata with id / profile / config) and ``agent_ids``, and never keeps "
"resident agent objects in the main process."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety:6 of
msgid "``step`` 每 tick 切批提交 ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task，跨 worker 并行；批内顺序执行（每个 agent 是 LLM-bound，顺序无妨）。"
msgstr ""
"On every tick, ``step`` splits agents into batches and submits ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Tasks for"
" parallel execution across workers. Agents within a batch run sequentially; each agent is LLM-"
"bound, so this is acceptable."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety:7 of
msgid ""
"``ask`` / ``intervene`` / ``run_questionnaire`` 为低频外部查询，按需在主进程 ``from_workspace`` 重建目标 agent "
"（workspace 在本地磁盘）。状态落盘使用 ``to_workspace`` / ``from_workspace`` （society 级 checkpoint）。"
msgstr ""
"``ask`` / ``intervene`` / ``run_questionnaire`` are low-frequency external queries that rebuild "
"the target agent in the main process with ``from_workspace`` on demand (workspaces are on local "
"disk). State persistence uses ``to_workspace`` / ``from_workspace`` (society-level checkpoint)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety:13 of
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Example::"

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety:12 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from datetime import datetime\n"
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.society import AgentSociety\n"
"\n"
"society = AgentSociety(\n"
"    agent_specs=[{\"id\":1,\"profile\":{...},\"config\":{...}}, ...],\n"
"    agent_class_name=\"PersonAgent\",\n"
"    env_router=env_proxy,\n"
"    service_proxy=proxy,\n"
"    start_t=datetime.now(),\n"
"    run_dir=Path(\"./run\"),\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"async with society:\n"
"    await society.run(num_steps=100, tick=3600)"
msgstr ""
"from datetime import datetime\n"
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.society import AgentSociety\n"
"\n"
"society = AgentSociety(\n"
"    agent_specs=[{\"id\":1,\"profile\":{...},\"config\":{...}}, ...],\n"
"    agent_class_name=\"PersonAgent\",\n"
"    env_router=env_proxy,\n"
"    service_proxy=proxy,\n"
"    start_t=datetime.now(),\n"
"    run_dir=Path(\"./run\"),\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"async with society:\n"
"    await society.run(num_steps=100, tick=3600)"

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:1 of
msgid "创建 record-based 仿真编排器。"
msgstr "Create a record-based simulation orchestrator."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"agent 元数据列表，每个形如 ``{\"id\": int, \"profile\": dict, \"config\": dict}`` "
"。仅元数据，不在构造时实例化。"
msgstr ""
"Agent metadata list. Each item has the form ``{\"id\": int, \"profile\": dict, "
"\"config\": dict}``. This is metadata only; agents are not instantiated during "
"construction."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:5 of
msgid "agent 类名（经 registry 解析，如 ``\"PersonAgent\"`` ）。"
msgstr "Agent class name resolved through the registry, such as ``\"PersonAgent\"``."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:6 of
msgid "环境路由器（in-process 或 ``EnvRouterProxy`` ）。"
msgstr "Environment router, either in-process or ``EnvRouterProxy``."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:7 of
msgid "仿真开始时间。"
msgstr "Simulation start time."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:8 of
msgid "运行目录（``run_dir/agents`` 为 agent workspaces 根）。"
msgstr "Run directory; ``run_dir/agents`` is the root for agent workspaces."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:9 of
msgid ""
"共享服务句柄（env / llm / trace / replay）。流式任务 处理必需——runner 任务通过它访问 LLM clients / env "
"actor。提供时 :meth:`init` 直接复用；``close`` 关闭其中 trace/replay actor。"
msgstr ""
"Shared service handles (env / llm / trace / replay). Required for streaming tasks: "
"runner tasks use it to access LLM clients and the env actor. When provided, "
":meth:`init` reuses it directly; ``close`` closes its trace / replay actor."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:12 of
msgid ""
"每 ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task 处理的 agent 数； ``None`` 时回落到 ``Config.BATCH_SIZE`` "
"（环境变量 ``AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE`` ，缺省 256）。"
msgstr ""
"Number of agents per ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task; ``None`` falls back to "
"``Config.BATCH_SIZE`` (environment variable ``AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE``, default "
"256)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.__init__:15 of
msgid "是否启用回放记录。"
msgstr "Whether to enable playback recording."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.current_time:1 of
msgid "返回当前仿真时间。"
msgstr "Returns the current simulation time."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.step_count:1 of
msgid "返回已执行的仿真步数。"
msgstr "Returns the number of executed simulation steps."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.agent_ids:1 of
msgid "返回所有 agent id（不暴露 agent 对象）。"
msgstr "Return all agent ids without exposing agent objects."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.agent_specs:1 of
msgid "返回 agent specs（元数据快照）。"
msgstr "Return agent specs as a metadata snapshot."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.token_stats:1 of
msgid "按模型聚合的 LLM token 用量（agent 侧，快照）。"
msgstr "LLM token usage aggregated by model (agent side, snapshot)."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.token_stats:3 of
msgid ""
"每项含 ``calls`` / ``input`` / ``output`` / ``cached_input`` 。 ``cached_input`` 是 ``input`` 中命中 "
"provider prompt 前缀缓存的部分。仅统计 agent 侧调用；env router（coder 角色）的用量见 :meth:`router_token_stats` 。"
msgstr ""
"Each entry contains ``calls`` / ``input`` / ``output`` / ``cached_input``. ``cached_input`` is "
"the portion of ``input`` served by the provider's prompt-prefix cache. Only agent-side calls are "
"counted; for env router (coder role) usage see :meth:`router_token_stats`."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.router_token_stats:1 of
msgid "env router（coder/summary 角色）的 token 用量快照。"
msgstr "Token usage snapshot for the env router (coder/summary roles)."

#: agentsociety2.society.AgentSociety.router_token_stats:3 of
msgid ":meth:`RouterBase.get_token_usages` 返回的是**快照而非增量**，所以这里取一次合并即可，不要按步累加，否则会重复计数。"
msgstr ""
":meth:`RouterBase.get_token_usages` returns a **snapshot, not a delta**, so take one merged "
"reading here; do not accumulate per step, or the counts will be double-counted."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.all_token_stats:1 of
msgid "agent 侧 + env router 侧的 token 用量合并快照。"
msgstr "Merged token usage snapshot: agent side + env router side."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.cache_hit_rate:1 of
msgid "Prompt 前缀缓存命中率（``cached_input / input`` ，全部调用合计）。"
msgstr "Prompt prefix cache hit rate (``cached_input / input``, over all calls combined)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.cache_hit_rate:4 of
msgid ""
"分母包含 ask 轮与一次性工具调用（world description、memory consolidation），这些结构上不可能命中前缀缓存、恒为 0%，因此该聚合值会**低估** "
"ReAct 循环自身的命中率。要看后者请用 ``llm.completion`` trace span 上的 ``llm.cache_hit_rate`` 。"
msgstr ""
"The denominator includes ask turns and one-shot tool calls (world description, memory "
"consolidation), which structurally cannot hit the prefix cache and are always 0%, so this "
"aggregate **underestimates** the ReAct loop's own hit rate. For the latter, use "
"``llm.cache_hit_rate`` on the ``llm.completion`` trace span."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.init:1 of
msgid "初始化：Ray / LLM dispatcher → ``service_proxy`` → replay → 批式创建 workspaces → env init。"
msgstr ""
"Initialize: Ray / LLM dispatcher -> ``service_proxy`` -> replay -> batched workspace creation -> "
"env init."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.close:1 of
msgid "关闭：env router + ``service_proxy`` 的 trace/replay 句柄 + LLM dispatcher。"
msgstr "Close: env router, trace / replay actors in ``service_proxy``, and the LLM dispatcher."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.to_workspace:1 of
msgid "持久化 society + env 状态（每步调用，无状态 resume）。"
msgstr "Persist society + env state (called every step; enables stateless resume)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.to_workspace:3 of
msgid ""
"让 env router 落盘各模块状态，并写 ``run_dir/SOCIETY_STEP.json`` （仅少量标量：当前时间 / 步数 / 已完成前置步数 / "
"terminated）。不可变的大字段（``agent_specs`` 等）只在 :meth:`init` 写一次到 ``SOCIETY.json`` ，避免每步重序列化。``run_dir``"
" 为空时 no-op；env 落盘失败时抛错，不提交总进度。"
msgstr ""
"Makes the env router flush each module's state and writes ``run_dir/SOCIETY_STEP.json`` (only a "
"few scalars: current time / step count / completed prefix steps / terminated). Large immutable "
"fields (``agent_specs`` etc.) are written once to ``SOCIETY.json`` in :meth:`init` to avoid re-"
"serializing every step. No-op when ``run_dir`` is empty; raises when env persistence fails, so "
"incomplete overall progress is never committed."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.to_workspace:8 of
msgid "保留以兼容旧调用签名（不再单独持久化）。"
msgstr "Kept for compatibility with the old call signature (no longer persisted separately)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.write_llm_stats_json:1 of
msgid "把 LLM token 用量与缓存命中率写到 ``run_dir/LLM_STATS.json`` 。"
msgstr "Write LLM token usage and cache hit rate to ``run_dir/LLM_STATS.json``."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.write_llm_stats_json:3 of
msgid ""
"含 agent 侧与 env router（coder）侧的合并快照、逐模型明细、以及聚合命中率。原始计数器一并保留——不同网关对 ``input`` 是否含 cache read "
"的口径不同，保留原值便于自行换算。"
msgstr ""
"Contains the merged snapshot of agent side + env router (coder) side, per-model breakdowns, and "
"the aggregate hit rate. Raw counters are also kept — gateways disagree on whether ``input`` "
"includes cache reads, so the original values let you convert yourself."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.write_llm_stats_json:5 of
msgid "写入的 payload；无 ``run_dir`` 时返回 ``None`` 。"
msgstr "The written payload; returns ``None`` when there is no ``run_dir``."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.mark_step_completed:1 of
msgid "标记第 ``step_idx`` 个顶层 step 已完成并立即持久化进度。"
msgstr "Mark the ``step_idx``-th top-level step as completed and persist progress immediately."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.mark_step_completed:3 of
msgid ""
"由 CLI 在每个顶层 step（含 Ask/Intervene/Questionnaire）成功后调用。游标语义为**最大连续完成前缀**（2026-10-19 修复）：游标只在 "
"``step_idx == 游标`` 时前进,后续成功步不再把被失败步隔开的缺口顶上去——失败步因此保持可重试,resume 不会永久跳过它。"
msgstr ""
"Called by the CLI after each top-level step (including Ask/Intervene/Questionnaire) succeeds. The"
" cursor semantics are the **longest completed contiguous prefix** (fixed 2026-10-19): the cursor "
"only advances when ``step_idx == completed_step_count``, and later successful steps no longer "
"push a gap left by a failed step past it — failed steps therefore stay retryable and resume never"
" skips them permanently."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.mark_step_completed:8 of
msgid ""
"背景(T2 生产实锤):旧语义 ``游标 = step_idx + 1`` 下,step 59 失败、 step 60 成功即把游标顶到 61,59 的时钟缺口永久丢失且"
" resume 空转 (96/96 全 skip)。间隔失败(非前缀)的 run step 必须由 resume 重跑; 问卷步重跑成本低(幂等重放),run 步从 "
"checkpoint 时钟重放同样幂等。"
msgstr ""
"Background (proven in T2 production): under the old semantics ``completed_step_count "
"= step_idx + 1``, a failure at step 59 followed by success at step 60 pushed the "
"cursor to 61; step 59's clock gap was lost forever and resume no-opped (96/96 "
"skipped). Run steps with non-prefix (gapped) failures must be rerun by resume; "
"questionnaire steps are cheap to rerun (idempotent replay), and run steps replayed "
"from the checkpoint clock are equally idempotent."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.from_workspace:1 of
msgid "从 ``run_dir`` 重建 society（resume）。"
msgstr "Rebuild the society from ``run_dir`` (resume)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.from_workspace:3 of
msgid ""
"读 ``SOCIETY.json`` （不可变：agent specs、env 模块类型+kwargs）+ ``SOCIETY_STEP.json`` "
"（每步标量：当前时间、步数、已完成前置步数）。 ``env_router`` 必须由调用方（CLI）预先构造（actor 不可在此重建）； env 模块状态由 actor"
" 在自身 ``init()`` 中恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Reads ``SOCIETY.json`` (immutable: agent specs, env module types + kwargs) + "
"``SOCIETY_STEP.json`` (per-step scalars: current time, step count, completed prefix "
"steps). ``env_router`` must be constructed beforehand by the caller (the CLI; the "
"actor cannot be rebuilt here); env module state is restored by the actor in its own "
"``init()``."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.from_workspace:8 of
msgid ""
"返回的 society 的 :meth:`init` 会跳过 agent workspace 创建与 profile 重写（原 run 已存在），也不会覆盖已有的 "
"``SOCIETY.json`` 。"
msgstr ""
"The returned society's :meth:`init` skips agent workspace creation and profile rewriting (the "
"original run already exists) and does not overwrite the existing ``SOCIETY.json``."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.from_workspace:11 of
msgid "``run_dir/SOCIETY.json`` 不存在。"
msgstr "``run_dir/SOCIETY.json`` does not exist."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.from_workspace:12 of
msgid "schema 不兼容或 checkpoint 损坏。"
msgstr "Incompatible schema or corrupted checkpoint."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.step:1 of
msgid "推进一次仿真步：sync clock → 切批 ``step_agent_batch`` → env.step → 前进时钟。"
msgstr ""
"Advance one simulation step: sync clock -> batch into ``step_agent_batch`` -> ``env.step`` -> "
"advance clock."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.run:1 of
msgid "运行多步仿真。"
msgstr "Run multi-step simulations."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.run:3 of
msgid "运行步数上限。"
msgstr "The upper limit of running steps."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.run:4 of
msgid "每步时间跨度（秒）。"
msgstr "Time span per step (seconds)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.ask:1 of
msgid "向仿真系统提问（由 helper 协调 agents/env 作答）。"
msgstr "Ask questions to the simulation system (helper coordinates agents/env to answer)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.ask:3 of
msgid "问题文本。"
msgstr "Question text."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.ask:4 of
msgid "答案文本。"
msgstr "Answer text."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.intervene:1 of
msgid "对仿真进行干预（由 helper 协调执行）。"
msgstr "Intervene in the simulation (coordinated by a helper)."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.intervene:3 of
msgid "干预指令文本。"
msgstr "Intervention instruction text."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.intervene:4 of
msgid "执行结果/反馈文本。"
msgstr "Execution results/feedback text."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.run_questionnaire:1 of
msgid "向目标 agents 发放问卷并返回结构化结果。"
msgstr "Send questionnaires to target agents and return structured results."

#: agentsociety2.society.society.AgentSociety.run_questionnaire:3 of
msgid ""
"目标 agent 按 id 切批，每批提交一个 ``questionnaire_agent_batch`` Ray Task （与 ``step`` "
"同款分布式批处理）：worker 进程内 ``from_workspace`` 重建本批 agents、并发跑完整个问卷、``to_workspace`` "
"落盘，再返回结构化结果。失败的单个 agent 被隔离（不中断整批），与 ``step_agent_batch`` 的容错语义一致。"
msgstr ""
"Target agents are batched by id, and each batch submits one "
"``questionnaire_agent_batch`` Ray Task, using the same distributed batch processing "
"pattern as ``step``. Inside the worker process, ``from_workspace`` rebuilds the batch"
" of agents, runs the full questionnaire concurrently, persists with ``to_workspace``,"
" and returns structured results. A failed individual agent is isolated and does not "
"interrupt the whole batch, matching the fault-tolerance semantics of "
"``step_agent_batch``."

