"先用 ``ReplayReader`` 查看 dataset catalog，再按 dataset 查询数据。目录布局与 JSONL 示例见 "
":doc:`/storage`；下方历史 SQLModel 只用于兼容读取旧数据库。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``ReplayReader`` to inspect the dataset catalog, then query by dataset. Directory"
" layouts and JSONL examples are in :doc:`/storage`; historical SQLModel classes below"
" only support older databases."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/storage.rst:9
msgid "ReplayWriter"
msgstr "ReplayWriter"

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplayWriter:1 of
msgid ":class:`ReplaySink` 的向后兼容别名。"
msgstr "Back-compat alias over :class:`ReplaySink`."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplayWriter:3 of
msgid ""
"旧的公开 API（:mod:`agentsociety2.storage` 、examples）用 ``.db`` 文件路径 构造 SQLite 写入器，并在使用前调用 "
"``await init()`` 。该写入器已被移除； 此别名保持符号可导入，并写入相同的 JSONL 格式，把旧的 ``db_path`` 映射为 replay "
"目录（去掉末尾的 ``.db`` ），使旧调用点无需 SQLite 即可继续工作。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy public API (:mod:`agentsociety2.storage`, examples) constructed a SQLite "
"writer with a ``.db`` file path and called ``await init()`` before use. That writer "
"is gone; this alias keeps the symbol importable and writes the same JSONL format, "
"mapping the legacy ``db_path`` to a replay directory (a trailing ``.db`` is stripped)"
" so old call sites keep working without SQLite."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/storage.rst:17
msgid "ReplaySink"
msgstr "ReplayWriter"

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink:1 of
msgid "每进程的分布式只追加 JSONL 回放写入器。"
msgstr "Per-process, distributed, append-only JSONL replay writer."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink:3 of
msgid ""
"每个写入进程（driver / env router actor / 每个 agent Ray task）各持 一个实例。各自持有打开的分片 "
"fd；逐分片的锁文件保证并发追加同一分片 文件对任意大小的行都是安全的。"
msgstr ""
"One instance per writer process (driver / env router actor / each agent Ray task). "
"Holds its own open shard fds; per-shard lock files make concurrent appends to the "
"same shard file safe for rows of any size."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink.init:1 of
msgid "空操作（仅为兼容旧写入器的 API 而保留）。"
msgstr "No-op (kept for API compatibility with the legacy writer)."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink.write:1 of
msgid "向 ``table`` 追加一行。"
msgstr "Append one row to ``table``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink.write_batch:1 of
msgid "向 ``table`` 追加多行（每个分片一次 flock）。"
msgstr "Append multiple rows to ``table`` (one flock per shard)."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink.register_table:1 of
msgid "把表 schema 记录到 ``_schema.json`` （幂等）。"
msgstr "Record a table's schema in ``_schema.json`` (idempotent)."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink.register_dataset:1 of
msgid "把数据集及其列记录到 ``_schema.json`` （幂等）。"
msgstr "Record a dataset + its columns in ``_schema.json`` (idempotent)."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.ReplaySink.close:1 of
msgid "关闭所有打开的分片 fd。"
msgstr "Close all open shard fds."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/storage.rst:25
