#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/storage.rst:53
msgid "分布式 Replay Proxy"
msgstr "Distributed Replay Proxy"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/storage.rst:55
msgid ""
"大规模仿真下，``ReplayProxy`` 只携带 ``replay_dir`` 与启用标志。各 agent / env / society 进程收到 proxy "
"后在本地懒加载 ``ReplaySink``，并直接 append sharded JSONL。"
msgstr ""
"In large-scale simulations, ``ReplayProxy`` only carries ``replay_dir`` and the "
"enabled flag. After each agent / env / society process receives the proxy, it lazily "
"loads a local ``ReplaySink`` and appends sharded JSONL directly."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/storage.rst:59
msgid "ReplayProxy"
msgstr "ReplayWriter"

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_proxy.ReplayProxy:1 of
msgid "分布式回放写入的可序列化配置。"
msgstr "Serializable configuration for distributed replay writes."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_proxy.ReplayProxy:3 of
msgid ""
"仅携带回放输出目录与启用标志——不含 Ray actor 句柄。各方法在首次使用时 懒构建并缓存进程本地的 :class:`ReplaySink` （由 "
"``replay_dir`` 构建）并委托 其执行，因此每个收到反序列化副本的 agent Ray task / env actor 都获得自己 的 sink "
"与自己的文件描述符。``enabled=False`` 使所有方法成为 no-op。"
msgstr ""
"Carries only the replay output directory and an enabled flag, with no Ray actor "
"handle. Methods lazily construct and cache a process-local :class:`ReplaySink` from "
"``replay_dir`` and delegate to it. Each agent Ray task or environment actor receiving"
" a deserialized copy therefore owns its sink and file descriptors. With "
"``enabled=False``, all methods become no-ops."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.build_replay_sink:1 of
msgid "从 :class:`ReplayProxy` 构建每进程的 :class:`ReplaySink` 。"
msgstr "Build a per-process :class:`ReplaySink` from a :class:`ReplayProxy`."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_sink.build_replay_sink:3 of
msgid "proxy 被禁用或未携带 ``replay_dir`` 时返回 ``None`` 。"
msgstr "Returns ``None`` when the proxy is disabled or carries no ``replay_dir``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text:1 of
msgid "原子地写入文本文件：写 ``path.tmp`` 再 ``os.replace`` 。"
msgstr "Atomically write a text file using ``path.tmp`` followed by ``os.replace``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text:3 of
msgid "``os.replace`` 在同一文件系统内是原子的，故进程在写盘中途被杀死也只会留下 完整的旧文件或完整的新文件，不会出现截断的 checkpoint。"
msgstr ""
"``os.replace`` is atomic within one filesystem. If the process is killed during "
"writing, the destination retains the complete old or new file rather than a truncated"
" checkpoint."

#: agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text:6 of
msgid "目标文件路径（父目录会自动创建）。"
msgstr "Destination file path; parent directories are created automatically."

#: agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text:7 of
msgid "文本内容。"
msgstr "Text content."

#: agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text:8 of
msgid "编码，默认 utf-8。"
msgstr "Encoding, UTF-8 by default."

