#: agentsociety2.backend.app:1 of
msgid "AI Social Scientist 的 FastAPI 应用。"
msgstr "FastAPI application for AI Social Scientist."

#: agentsociety2.backend.app:3 of
msgid ""
"注册实验、回放、参数、模块与技能管理路由，并配置应用生命周期、可信主机和浏览器来源检查。服务入口见 :mod:`agentsociety2.backend.run`，HTTP 调用方式见 "
":doc:`/api/http`。"
msgstr ""
"Registers experiment, replay, parameter, module and skill-management routes, and configures the "
"application lifecycle, trusted hosts and browser-origin checks. See "
":mod:`agentsociety2.backend.run` for the entry point and :doc:`/api/http` for HTTP usage."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/api/backend.rst:14
msgid "服务启动"
msgstr "Starting the service"

#: agentsociety2.backend.run:1 of
msgid "启动 AI Social Scientist 后端。"
msgstr "Start the AI Social Scientist backend."

#: agentsociety2.backend.run:3 of
msgid ""
"通过 ``python -m agentsociety2.backend.run`` 运行 "
":mod:`agentsociety2.backend.app`。``BACKEND_HOST``、``BACKEND_PORT`` 与 ``BACKEND_LOG_LEVEL`` "
"控制监听地址、端口和日志等级；``WORKSPACE_PATH`` 配置允许访问的研究工作区。访问说明见 :doc:`/api/http`。"
msgstr ""
"Run :mod:`agentsociety2.backend.app` with ``python -m agentsociety2.backend.run``. "
"``BACKEND_HOST``, ``BACKEND_PORT`` and ``BACKEND_LOG_LEVEL`` control the bind address, port and "
"log level; ``WORKSPACE_PATH`` configures the allowed research workspace. See :doc:`/api/http` for"
" access instructions."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.prefill_params:1 of
msgid "管理工作区预填充参数。"
msgstr "Manage workspace prefilled parameters."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.prefill_params:3 of
msgid "为配置界面读取和更新研究工作区中的预填充参数。参数组织方式见 :doc:`/module_and_parameter_management`；HTTP 请求模型由本模块定义。"
msgstr ""
"Reads and updates research-workspace prefilled parameters for the configuration interface. See "
":doc:`/module_and_parameter_management` for parameter organization; this module defines the HTTP "
"request models."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.replay:1 of
msgid "查询实验回放数据。"
msgstr "Query experiment replay data."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.replay:3 of
msgid "为回放界面提供实验元信息、数据集目录与记录查询。底层读取接口见 :class:`agentsociety2.storage.ReplayReader`，数据布局见 :doc:`/storage`。"
msgstr ""
"Provides experiment metadata, dataset catalogs and record queries for replay interfaces. See "
":class:`agentsociety2.storage.ReplayReader` for the reader and :doc:`/storage` for the data "
"layout."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.custom:1 of
msgid "扫描、校验和管理工作区自定义模块。"
msgstr "Scan, validate and manage workspace-custom modules."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.custom:3 of
msgid "调用模块扫描器生成配置元数据，并提供模块列表、状态查询、测试与清理入口。模块编写和发现流程见 :doc:`/custom_modules`。"
msgstr ""
"Uses the module scanner to generate configuration metadata and provides module listing, status "
"queries, testing and cleanup. See :doc:`/custom_modules` for authoring and discovery."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.modules:1 of
msgid "查询可用的智能体类和环境模块。"
msgstr "Query available agent classes and environment modules."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.modules:3 of
msgid ""
"为配置编辑器提供内置模块与工作区自定义模块的元数据。模块发现与注册由 :class:`agentsociety2.registry.ModuleRegistry` 提供；HTTP "
"路径和参数见运行中后端的 Swagger 文档。"
msgstr ""
"Provides built-in and workspace-custom module metadata for configuration editors. Discovery and "
"registration use :class:`agentsociety2.registry.ModuleRegistry`; consult the running backend "
"Swagger documentation for HTTP paths and parameters."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.agent_skills:1 of
msgid "管理可发现的智能体行为技能。"
msgstr "Manage discoverable agent behavior skills."

#: agentsociety2.backend.routers.agent_skills:3 of
msgid ""
"提供技能列表、工作区扫描、目录导入、创建、ZIP 上传与内容查询。元数据由 :mod:`agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_registry` "
"管理；技能的激活与执行发生在仿真运行时，见 :doc:`/agent_skills`。"
msgstr ""
"Provides skill listing, workspace scanning, directory import, creation, ZIP upload and content "
"queries. Metadata uses :mod:`agentsociety2.agent.base.skill_registry`; activation and execution "
"occur in the simulation runtime, as explained in :doc:`/agent_skills`."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.__init__:1 of
msgid "绑定已有的回放目录，查询时再创建 DuckDB 内存连接。"
msgstr "Bind an existing replay directory and create the DuckDB connection lazily."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.__init__:3 of
msgid "含有 ``_schema.json`` 的回放目录。"
msgstr "Replay directory containing ``_schema.json``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.__init__:4 of
