#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.close:1 of
msgid "释放当前 DuckDB 连接；重复调用是安全的。"
msgstr "Release the current DuckDB connection; repeated calls are safe."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.close:3 of
msgid "关闭后仍保留目录与元数据缓存，下次数据查询会重新建立连接。"
msgstr "The directory and metadata cache remain available; a later query opens a new connection."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.load_dataset_catalog:1 of
msgid "读取并缓存数据集目录，保留列定义、排序规则和能力标记。"
msgstr "Read and cache the dataset catalog, preserving columns, ordering and capabilities."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.get_dataset_by_id:1 of
msgid "按稳定标识读取一个数据集的目录条目。"
msgstr "Look up a catalog entry by its stable dataset identifier."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.get_dataset_by_id:3 of
msgid "目录返回的完整标识，例如 ``core.agent_profile``。"
msgstr "Full identifier from the catalog, such as ``core.agent_profile``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.get_dataset_by_id:4 of
msgid "可传给行查询方法的数据集元数据。"
msgstr "Dataset metadata accepted by row-query methods."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.get_dataset_by_id:5 of
msgid "未找到该标识。"
msgstr "The identifier was not found."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.find_dataset_by_capability:1 of
msgid "查找具有指定能力标记的数据集，可同时限制数据集类型。"
msgstr "Find a dataset by capability, optionally restricted to a dataset kind."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.find_dataset_by_capability:3 of
msgid "多个匹配项按 ``dataset_id`` 排序后返回第一个，便于确定性选择。"
msgstr "When multiple entries match, return the first in ``dataset_id`` order for deterministic selection."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.find_dataset_by_capability:5 of
msgid "能力标记，例如 ``agent_profile`` 或 ``timeseries``。"
msgstr "Capability such as ``agent_profile`` or ``timeseries``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.find_dataset_by_capability:6 of
msgid "可选的数据集类型，例如 ``entity_static``。"
msgstr "Optional dataset kind, such as ``entity_static``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.find_dataset_by_capability:7 of
msgid "没有同时满足条件的数据集。"
msgstr "No dataset matches both conditions."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.normalize_row:1 of
msgid "根据列元数据解码 JSON，并将日期和字节转换为可序列化值。"
msgstr "Decode JSON using column metadata and serialize dates and bytes."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.normalize_row:3 of
msgid "返回新的行字典，不修改传入的记录。"
msgstr "Return a new row dictionary without modifying the input record."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.fetch_dataset_rows:1 of
msgid "读取数据集记录，支持投影、排序和按步号或实体过滤。"
msgstr "Read dataset records with projection, ordering and step or entity filters."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.fetch_dataset_rows:3 of
msgid ""
"``start_step``、``end_step`` 与 ``max_step`` 包含边界；省略排序列时使用数据集的 ``default_order``。 "
"``latest_per_entity`` 需要数据集声明实体键和步号键。仅在提供 ``limit`` 时可使用非零 ``offset``。"
msgstr ""
"``start_step``, ``end_step`` and ``max_step`` are inclusive. Without an explicit sort column, use"
" the dataset ``default_order``.\n"
"``latest_per_entity`` requires entity and step keys. A nonzero ``offset`` requires a finite "
"``limit``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.fetch_dataset_rows:6 of
msgid "``columns`` 列名列表与 ``rows`` 记录列表。"
msgstr "A ``columns`` list and a ``rows`` list."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.fetch_dataset_rows:7 of
msgid "列名、排序或过滤条件不符合数据集定义。"
msgstr "Columns, ordering or filters do not match the dataset definition."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.count_dataset_rows:1 of
msgid "统计符合步号与实体过滤条件的记录数。"
msgstr "Count records matching step and entity filters."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.count_dataset_rows:3 of
msgid "``latest_per_entity=True`` 时按每个实体的最新记录计数；可用同一组过滤条件与行查询核对分页总数。"
msgstr ""
"With ``latest_per_entity=True``, count the latest record per entity. Reuse the row-query filters "
"to obtain a consistent pagination total."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.query_dataset_rows:1 of
msgid "按页查询记录，并返回相同过滤条件下的总数。"
msgstr "Query one page and count all records matching the same filters."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.query_dataset_rows:3 of
msgid "从 1 开始的页码。"
msgstr "Page number starting at 1."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.query_dataset_rows:4 of
msgid "每页记录数，应为正整数。"
msgstr "Positive number of records per page."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.query_dataset_rows:5 of
msgid "``columns``、当前页 ``rows`` 与过滤后的 ``total``。"
msgstr "``columns``, the current page of ``rows`` and the filtered ``total``."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.distinct_values:1 of
msgid "列出一列的非空去重值，默认按该列升序排列。"
msgstr "List distinct non-null column values, sorted in ascending order by default."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.count_distinct:3
#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.distinct_values:3 of
msgid "数据集定义中的列名。"
msgstr "Column name from the dataset definition."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.distinct_values:4 of
msgid "是否排序；关闭后不保证返回顺序。"
msgstr "Whether to sort; otherwise order is not guaranteed."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.count_distinct:4
#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.distinct_values:5 of
msgid "列名不属于该数据集。"
msgstr "The column is not part of the dataset."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.count_distinct:1 of
msgid "统计一列的非空去重值数量。"
msgstr "Count distinct non-null column values."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.min_value:1 of
msgid "返回一列的最小非空值，无记录时返回 ``None``。"
msgstr "Return the smallest non-null column value, or ``None`` for no records."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.max_value:3
#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.min_value:3 of
msgid "比较方式由列的存储类型决定；列名必须来自数据集定义。"
msgstr "Comparison follows the stored column type; the column must belong to the dataset."

#: agentsociety2.storage.replay_reader.ReplayReader.max_value:1 of
msgid "返回一列的最大非空值，无记录时返回 ``None``。"
msgstr "Return the largest non-null column value, or ``None`` for no records."
